<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Marc</para>
  <para style="toc1">LEVANJIL SELON MARC</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marc</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mc</para>
  <para style="mt1">LEVANJIL SELON MARC</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Kòmansman bòn nouvèl Jésus Kris la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:3">Mat 4:3</ref></char></note>Fis Bondye a. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Jan li ekri nan Ésaïe, pwofèt la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:1-11">Mat 3:1-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Gade byen, Mwen voye mesaje Mwen an pa devan nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">ki va prepare chemen nou;<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">És 40:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Se vwa a youn k ap kriye nan dezè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:10">Mat 11:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:10">Luc 7:10</ref></char>
    </note>‘Prepare chemen SENYÈ a; fè wout li dwat.’”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Jean Baptiste te parèt nan savann nan pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:24">Trav 13:24</ref></char></note>preche batèm repantans lan pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:77">Luc 1:77</ref></char></note>padon peche yo.<verse eid="MRK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Tout peyi Judée a t ap prale bò kote li avèk tout pèp Jérusalem lan. Konsa, yo t ap batize pa li menm nan larivyè Jourdain an. Yo t ap konfese peche yo.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Jean te abiye avèk pwal chamo. Yon sentiwon te antoure senti li, epi manje li se te krikèt avèk myèl sovaj. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Li t ap preche pou di: “Apre mwen gen youn k ap vini ki pi gran pase m, epi mwen pa menm dign pou m ta bese demare lasèt sandal Li. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Mwen batize nou avèk dlo, men Li va batize nou avèk Lespri Sen an.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan jou sa yo, Jésus te sòti Nazareth nan Galilée, e te batize pa Jean nan Jourdain an. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Nan menm moman ke Li te sòti nan dlo a, Li te wè syèl la vin louvri, e Lespri a kon yon toutrèl te vin desann sou Li. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Yon vwa te sòti nan syèl la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sòm 2:7</ref></char></note>“Ou menm se Fis byeneme Mwen an; nan Ou menm, Mwen byen kontan.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Nan menm moman an Lespri a te pouse Li ale nan dezè a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Konsa, Li te nan dezè a pou karant jou pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:10">Mat 4:10</ref></char></note>Satan t ap tante Li. Li te avèk bèt sovaj yo, epi se zanj yo ki te okipe Li.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:12">Mat 4:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, apre Jean te fin arete, Jésus te vini Galilée. Li t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4:23</ref></char></note>preche Bòn Nouvèl Bondye a. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:4">Gal 4:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Lè a gen tan rive, epi wayòm Bondye a pwòch; repanti e kwè nan Bòn Nouvèl la.”</char><verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:2-11">Luc 5:2-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pandan li t ap pase bò kote lanmè Galilée a, Li te wè Simon avèk André, frè a Simon an, ki t ap voye yon senn nan lanmè a, paske se moun lapèch yo te ye. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Swiv Mwen, e M ap fè nou fè lapèch moun.” </char> <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />La menm, yo te kite senn yo pou te swiv Li.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Pi lwen Li te wè Jacques, fis Zébédée a, ak Jean, frè li a, ki t ap repare senn yo nan kannòt la. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Lapoula Li te rele yo, e yo te kite Zébédée, papa yo, nan kannòt la avèk sèvitè jounalye yo, e te sòti pou swiv Li.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yo te ale Capernaüm. Imedyatman nan Saba a, Li te antre nan sinagòg la pou l te kòmanse enstwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:21">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luc 4:31-37</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mat 7:28</ref></char></note>Yo te etone pou jan Li te enstwi a. Paske Li te enstwi kon yon moun ki te gen otorite, e pa kon skrib yo.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Nan menm lè sa a, te gen yon mesye nan sinagòg la ki te gen yon move lespri. Li t ap rele fò <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />pou di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:29">Mat 8:29</ref></char></note>“Kisa nou gen avè w, Jésus de Nazareth? Èske Ou vini pou detwi nou? Mwen konnen kilès Ou ye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luc 4:24</ref></char></note>Sila ki Sen Bondye a!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Konsa Jésus te reprimande L. Li te di l: <char style="wj">“Pe la, e sòti nan li!” </char><verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Move lespri a te boulvèse li avèk gwo kriz. Li te kriye ak yon vwa fò, e te kite li.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Yo tout te etone. Yo te diskite pami yo e te di: “Kisa sa ye? Yon enstriksyon nèf? Avèk otorite Li kòmande menm move lespri yo, e yo obeyi Li!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Byen vit nouvèl la te kouri toupatou nan tout anviwon Galilée a.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:14">Mat 8:14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:15">15</ref></char>
    </note>Depi lè yo kite sinagòg la, yo te antre lakay Simon avèk André ansanm avèk Jacques ak Jean.<verse eid="MRK 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Bèlmè Simon an te kouche malad avèk yon lafyèv. Imedyatman an yo te pale avèk Li konsènan li.<verse eid="MRK 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Jésus te vin kote l. Li te leve li pa men li, epi lafyèv la te kite li. Konsa li te sèvi yo.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:16">Mat 8:16</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:17">17</ref></char>
    </note>Lè nwit lan te rive e solèy la fin kouche, yo te pote bay Li tout moun ki te malad yo, avèk sila ki te gen move lespri yo. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:21">Mc 1:21</ref></char></note>vil la te rasanble devan pòt la.<verse eid="MRK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4:23</ref></char></note>geri anpil moun ki te malad avèk plizyè kalite maladi, e te chase anpil dyab. Li pa t kite yo pale paske yo te konnen kilès Li te ye.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 4:42">Luc 4:42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:43">43</ref></char>
    </note>Nan granmmaten, pandan li te toujou fènwa, Li te leve e te ale deyò nan yon kote izole kote li t ap priye.<verse eid="MRK 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Konsa, Simon avèk sila ki te avè l yo t ap chèche Li. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Yo te twouve li, e te di L: “Tout moun ap chèche Ou”.<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Annou ale yon lòt kote nan vil ki toupre yo pou M kab preche la tou, paske se pou sa ke M te vini.” </char> <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4:23</ref></char></note> Li te ale nan sinagòg yo toupatou nan tout Galilée, e Li t ap preche, e chase move lespri yo.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:2-4">Mat 8:2-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yon lepre te vin kote L, e t ap sipliye L. Li te tonbe ajenou devan L, e te di L: “Si Ou vle, Ou kapab fè m vin pwòp”.<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Kè Li te vin plen avèk konpasyon. Li te lonje men L, te touche li, e te di L: <char style="wj">“Mwen vle. Vin pwòp”. </char> <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Konsa, touswit lèp la te kite l, e li te vin pwòp.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Konsa, Li te avèti li byen sevè, e byen vit, Li te voye l ale. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Li te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:4">Mat 8:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Fè atansyon pou pa di anyen a pèsòn; men </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1">Lev 14:1</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">ale montre ou menm a prèt la, e ofri li yon ofrann pou pirifikasyon ou, sa ke Moïse te kòmande a, kon yon temwayaj a yo menm.”</char><verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Men li te ale deyò e te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:15">Mat 28:15</ref></char></note>pwoklame sa toupatou. Li te gaye nouvèl la jouk lè Jésus pa t kapab antre piblikman nan yon vil ankò, men te rete andeyò nan zòn dezè yo. Moun yo te sòti vin kote l de tout andwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Lè L te retounen kèk jou apre, nouvèl la te gaye ke Li te lakay Li.<verse eid="MRK 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Byen vit <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:45">Mc 1:45</ref></char></note>anpil moun te rasanble devan pòt la pou jis lè pa t gen plas ankò, e Li te pale pawòl la bay yo.<verse eid="MRK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Epi yo te pote bay Li yon paralitik ki te pote pa kat mesye. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Yo pa t kab rive bò kote L akoz foul la. Konsa, yo te retire twati kay la, e lè yo te fin fouye yon twou, yo te lonje palèt la desann sou li avèk mesye paralize ki te kouche a.<verse eid="MRK 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Jésus, lè L te wè lafwa yo, te di a paralitik la: <char style="wj">“Fis Mwen, peche ou yo padone.” </char><verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Men te gen kèk nan skrib yo ki te chita la ki te rezone nan kè yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:10">Luc 6:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Poukisa nonm sa a pale konsa? L ap blasfeme; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:25">És 43:25</ref></char></note>kilès sof ke Bondye sèl ki kab padone peche?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Epi nan menm moman an, Jésus, okouran nan lespri Li ke yo t ap refleshi konsa, te di yo: <char style="wj">“Poukisa nou ap rezone sou bagay sa yo konsa nan kè nou? </char> <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" /><char style="wj">Kisa ki pi fasil pou di a paralitik la: ‘Peche ou yo padone’, oubyen leve pran palèt ou e mache?’ </char> <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" /><char style="wj">Men pou nou ka konnen ke Fis a Lòm nan gen otorite sou latè pou padone peche yo” </char>—Li te di a paralitik la: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" /><char style="wj">“Mwen di ou leve, pran palèt ou e ale lakay ou.” </char><verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Byen vit, li te leve, pran palèt li, e te sòti deyò devan tout moun. Yo tout te etone. Yo t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:8">Mat 9:8</ref></char></note>bay glwa a Bondye. Yo t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:33">Mat 9:33</ref></char></note>“Nou pa janm wè yon bagay konsa”.<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Li te ale deyò ankò bò kote lanmè a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:45">Mc 1:45</ref></char></note>Tout foul la te vin kote Li, e Li t ap enstwi yo. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:9-13">Mc 9:9-13</ref></char></note>Pandan Li t ap pase, Li te wè Lévi, fis a Alphée a, ki te chita nan biwo kontribisyon an. Li te di li: <char style="wj">“Swiv Mwen”!</char> Konsa, li te leve pou swiv Li.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Li te vin rive pandan Li te sou tab lakay li a, ke anpil kolektè kontribisyon avèk pechè yo t ap dine avèk Jésus ak disip Li yo. Yo te anpil, e yo t ap swiv Li. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:30">Luc 5:30</ref></char></note>skrib ak Farizyen yo te wè ke Li t ap manje avèk pechè ak ajan kontribisyon yo, yo te kòmanse di a disip Li yo: “Poukisa L ap manje e bwè avèk ajan kontribisyon yo avèk pechè yo?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Lè L te tande sa, Jésus te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:12">Mat 9:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 9:13">13</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Se pa sila ki ansante yo ki bezwen yon doktè, men sila ki malad yo. Mwen pa t vini pou rele moun ki jis yo, men pechè yo”. </char><verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Disip a Jean avèk Farizyen yo t ap fè jèn, epi yo te vin di L: “Poukisa disip a Jean avèk disip a Farizyen yo fè jèn, men disip Ou yo pa fè L?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Pandan jenn gason k ap marye a avèk yo, èske patisipan fèt yo fè jèn? Non, depi jennonm nan la, yo pa kapab fè jèn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" /><char style="wj">Men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:15">Mat 9:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">jou yo ap vini lè jennonm nan va retire de yo. Konsa, nan jou sa a, ya fè jèn.</char><verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />
    <char style="wj">“Pèsòn pa koud yon moso twal ki poko lave sou yon vye rad, pou lè l fin lave, twal nèf la pa sere e separe de li; nèf la va kite ansyen an, e rad la va vin chire pi mal.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" /><char style="wj">E pèsòn pa mete diven nèf nan ansyen veso kwi; otreman, diven an va pete kwi a e diven an va vin pèdi, ansanm ak kwi a; men diven nèf toujou ale nan veso kwi ki fre.” </char><verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, li te vin rive ke pandan Li t ap pase nan chan sereyal yo nan Saba a, pandan disip Li yo t ap ale, yo te kòmanse keyi tèt grenn sereyal.<verse eid="MRK 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Farizyen yo t ap di Li: “Gade la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:2">Mat 12:2</ref></char></note>poukisa y ap fè sa ki pa pèmi nan Saba”?<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Èske nou pa janm li sa ke David te fè lè li te nan bezwen e te vin grangou, li menm avèk moun pa l yo?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" /><char style="wj">Kijan li te antre menm nan kay Bondye a nan tan wo prèt la</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1">I Sam 21:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Abiathar? Jan li te manje pen konsakre a ki pa pèmi pou pèsòn manje sof ke prèt yo, e li te bay li osi a sila ki te avè l yo?”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Jésus te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:12">Egz 23:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Saba a te fèt pou lòm, e pa lòm pou Saba a.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" /><char style="wj">Konsa, Fis a Lòm nan se Mèt la, menm a Saba a.” </char><verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te antre ankò nan sinagòg la, epi yon nonm te la avèk yon men sèch. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Yo t ap veye L pou wè si Li t ap geri li nan Saba a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:10">Mat 12:10</ref></char></note>pou yo ta kapab akize Li.<verse eid="MRK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Li te di nonm avèk men sèch la: <char style="wj">“Leve vin devan!” </char><verse eid="MRK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Li te di yo: “<char style="wj">Èske li pèmi nan Saba a pou fè byen, oubyen pou fè mal, pou sove yon vi, oubyen pou touye”? </char> Men yo te rete an silans.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Lè L fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:10">Luc 6:10</ref></char></note>gade toupatou, byen fache, byen blese akoz kè di yo, Li te di a nonm nan: <char style="wj">“Lonje men ou”. </char> Li te lonje l, e men li te geri.<verse eid="MRK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Imedyatman, Farizyen yo te ale deyò pou fè konplo kont Li avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:16">Mat 22:16</ref></char></note>Ewodyen yo pou wè kijan yo ta kapab detwi Li.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:15">Mat 12:15</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 12:16">16</ref></char>
    </note>Jésus te retire kò l bò kote lanmè a ansanm avèk disip Li yo. Yon gran foul ki sòti Galilée t ap swiv li, ansanm avèk moun peyi Judée yo, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />avèk Jérusalem, Idumée ak lòtbò Jourdain an ak landwa Tyr avèk Sidon. Yon gwo foul moun ki te tande tout sa Li t ap fè, te vin kote Li. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:1">Mc 4:1</ref></char></note> Li te di disip Li yo ke yon kannòt ta dwe prepare pou Li, akoz gran foul la, pou yo pa peze L twòp. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Paske Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4:23</ref></char></note>geri anpil moun, e kon rezilta, tout sa ki te aflije yo t ap peze L pou yo ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:21">Mat 9:21</ref></char></note>touche L.<verse eid="MRK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />E nenpòt lè ke move lespri yo te wè L, yo t ap tonbe devan Li, kriye fò e di: “Ou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:3">Mat 4:3</ref></char></note>Fis Bondye a!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Konsa, Li te reponn yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:4">Mat 8:4</ref></char></note>avèk severite pou yo pa di ki moun li te ye.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:1">Mat 5:1</ref></char></note>monte sou mòn nan, pou L te rele sila ke Li menm te vle yo, e yo te vin kote Li. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Li te dezinye douz yo, pou yo ta kapab avè L, e pou Li ta kapab voye yo deyò pou preche, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />e pou yo ta kab gen otorite pou chase move lespri yo: <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:13">Trav 1:13</ref></char></note>Simon, ki rele Pierre, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Jacques, fis Zébédée a, avèk Jean, frè a Jacques, (a li menm Li te bay non Boanergès ki vle di Fis a tonnè yo); <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />André, ak Philippe, ak Barthélemy, ak Matthieu, ak Thomas, ak Jacques, fis Alphée a, ak Thaddée, e Simon, Zelòt la; <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ansanm avèk Judas Iscariot, sila ki te trayi Jésus a.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Apre, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 2:1">Mc 2:1</ref></char></note>retounen lakay Li, e foul la te rasanble ankò jiskaske yo pa t kab menm manje yon repa.<verse eid="MRK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:20">Jn 10:20</ref></char></note>pwòp fanmi pa Li te tande sa, yo te ale deyò pou pran chaj Li, paske yo t ap di: “Li gen tan pèdi bon tèt Li”.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Konsa, skrib ki te sòti Jérusalem yo t ap di: “Se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:25">Mat 10:25</ref></char></note>Béelzébul menm ki pran L. Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9:34</ref></char></note>chase move lespri yo pa mèt move lespri yo”.<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:25-29">Mat 12:25-29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te rele yo a Li menm, e te kòmanse pale ak yo an parabòl: <char style="wj">“Kijan Satan kapab chase Satan mete l deyò? </char> <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" /><char style="wj">Si yon wayòm divize kont tèt li, wayòm sa a p ap kapab kanpe.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" /><char style="wj">Si yon kay divize kont tèt li, kay sa a p ap kab kanpe.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" /><char style="wj">Si</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:10">Mat 4:10</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Satan fin leve kont tèt li, epi li divize, li p ap kab kanpe, men li fini! </char><verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:24">És 49:24</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 49:25">25</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Men pèsòn p ap kapab antre lakay a yon nonm fò, e piyaje byen li, sof ke premyèman li mare mesye fò a; e apre sa, l ap piyaje kay li.</char><verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:31-32">Mat 12:31-32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Anverite, Mwen di nou tout peche fis a lòm yo ap padone, e menm nenpòt blasfèm yo fè; </char> <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" /><char style="wj">men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luc 12:10</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nenpòt moun ki blasfeme kont Lespri Sen an p ap janm gen padon, men yo va rete koupab de yon peche etènèl.” </char><verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Paske yo t ap di ke “Li gen yon move lespri”.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, manman Li, avèk frè Li yo te rive kanpe deyò a, yo te voye kote Li e te rele Li.<verse eid="MRK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Yon foul te chita toupatou antoure L, e yo te di Li: “Gade, manman Ou avèk frè Ou yo ap chèche Ou deyò a”.<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Li te reponn yo e te di: <char style="wj">“Kilès ki manman M ak frè M?” </char><verse eid="MRK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Li te gade toupatou sou sila ki te chita antoure Li yo e Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:49">Mat 12:49</ref></char></note> “<char style="wj">Gade, men manman M avèk frè M yo!</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" /><char style="wj">Paske sila ki</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:6">Ef 6:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">fè volonte a Papa M yo, se yo menm ki frè M, sè M, ak manman M”. </char><verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:1-15">Mat 13:1-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te kòmanse enstwi yo ankò bò kote lanmè a. Yon gwo foul te ransanble kote Li jiskaske Li te vin antre nan yon kannòt sou lanmè a e Li te chita. Tout foul la te kanpe atè bò lanmè a.<verse eid="MRK 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Konsa, Li te enstwi yo anpil bagay an parabòl. Li t ap di yo nan ansèyman li; <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" /><char style="wj">“Koute! Yon moun ki t ap simen te ale deyò pou simen grenn.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:3">Mat 13:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" /><char style="wj">Pandan li t ap simen, kèk grenn te tonbe akote wout la pou zwazo yo vin manje l nèt.</char><verse eid="MRK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />
    <char style="wj">“Lòt grenn te tonbe nan wòch kote pa t gen anpil tè. Byen vit, li te leve, paske tè a pa t gen pwofondè.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" /><char style="wj">Konsa, lè solèy la fin leve, li te vin brile, e akoz li pa t gen rasin, li te fennen.</char><verse eid="MRK 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />
    <char style="wj">“Lòt grenn tonbe pami pikan yo. Pikan yo leve toufe li, e li pa t bay donn.</char><verse eid="MRK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />
    <char style="wj">“Lòt grenn te tonbe nan bon tè e pandan yo t ap grandi, ogmante, yo vin bay yon rekòlt ki te pwodwi trant, swasant, e menm san fwa.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Konsa li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:15">Mat 11:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Sila ki gen zòrèy pou tande, kite l tande”.</char><verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Pandan Li te apa pou kont Li, sila ki t ap swiv Li yo ansanm avèk douz yo t ap poze L kesyon sou parabòl yo.<verse eid="MRK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“A nou menm te gen tan bay mistè a wayòm Bondye a; men </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:12">I Kor 5:12</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">sila ki rete deyò yo, ap resevwa tout bagay an parabòl.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" /><char style="wj">Pou l rive ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">És 6:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Malgre yo wè, yo kapab wè san apèsi; e pandan y ap tande, yo kapab tande e pa konprann. Otreman, yo ta kab retounen pou twouve padon.” </char><verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Èske nou pa konprann parabòl sila a? Alò kijan nou va konprann tout parabòl yo?</char><verse eid="MRK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />
    <char style="wj">“Moun k ap simen an simen pawòl la.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" /><char style="wj">Se sila ki akote wout yo, ke lè pawòl la fin simen, yo tande. Men byen vit,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:10">Mat 4:10</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Satan vin pran pawòl ki te simen an, e rachte l soti nan yo.</char><verse eid="MRK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />
    <char style="wj">“E nan yon jan ki sanble ak sa, sila yo se yo menm ki te simen kote ki plen wòch yo. Lè yo fin tande pawòl la, byen vit, yo resevwa l avèk jwa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" /><char style="wj">Men yo pa gen rasin fon nan yo menm. Yo la pou yon ti tan. Lè afliksyon oswa pèsekisyon vini akoz pawòl la, lapoula yo vin chite.</char><verse eid="MRK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />
    <char style="wj">“Lòt yo se sila yo ki te te simen pami pikan yo. Se yo ki te tande pawòl yo,</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" /><char style="wj">men tout pwoblèm </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 23:4">Pwov 23:4</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">mond sa a ak</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 23:4">Pwov 23:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sediksyon richès yo, avèk lanvi pou lòt bagay toufe pawòl la, pou li pa donnen fwi.</char><verse eid="MRK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />
    <char style="wj">“Sila ki te te simen nan bon tè a, se yo menm ki te tande pawòl la, yo te aksepte li, e yo te vin</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:2">Jn 15:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">bay fwi trant, swasant e menm san fwa.” </char><verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Konsa Li t ap di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Èske yon lanp pote pou mete anba yon panyen oubyen anba yon kabann? Èske yo pa pote li pou mete li sou yon chandelye?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Paske anyen pa kache, sof ke pou revele, ni anyen pa an sekrè, sof ke pou parèt nan limyè.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:15">Mat 11:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Si yon moun gen zòrèy pou tande, kite l tande.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />E Li t ap di yo: <char style="wj">“Fè atansyon a sa nou koute.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mat 7:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Menm jan ke nou mezire bay, li va mezire remèt a nou menm; e menm plis, y ap bannou ki tande.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Paske a nenpòt moun ki genyen, l ap resevwa anplis, e a nenpòt moun ki pa genyen, menm sa li genyen an ap retire nan men li.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />E Li t ap di: <char style="wj">“Wayòm syèl la se tankou yon mesye k ap voye semans sou latè.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" /><char style="wj">Konsa, l ale sou kabann li nan aswè, li leve lajounen, e semans lan pouse e grandi; kijan sa fè fèt, li menm pa konnen.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" /><char style="wj">Tè a pwodwi rekòlt pou kont li; premyèman flèch, answit tèt la, e apre sa, grenn mi yo nan tèt la.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" /><char style="wj">Men depi rekòlt la vin prè, byen vit l ap bay li kouto, paske lè rekòlt la rive.” </char><verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te di: <char style="wj">“Kijan n ap imajine wayòm Bondye a, oubyen selon ki parabòl nou kapab reprezante li?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" /><char style="wj">Li tankou yon grenn moutad ke lè l simen nan tè, li pi piti pase tout grenn ki sou latè.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" /><char style="wj">Malgre sa, lè l fin simen, li grandi e vin pi gwo pase tout lòt plant nan jaden yo, epi fè gwo branch, pou zwazo anlè yo kab vin fè nich anba lonbraj li.” </char><verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Ak anpil parabòl konsa, Li te pale pawòl la avèk yo nan limit yo ta kapab tande l pou konprann. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Li pa t pale avèk yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:34">Mat 13:34</ref></char></note>san parabòl; men Li t ap eksplike tout bagay an prive a disip Li yo.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:18-27">Mat 8:18-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan jou sa a, lè lannwit vin rive, Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Annou pase pa lòtbò”.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Yo te kite foul la e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mat 3:9</ref></char></note>pran Li avèk yo jan Li te ye nan kannòt la. Anplis, te gen lòt kannòt ki te avèk Li.<verse eid="MRK 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Konsa, te vin leve yon gwo van tanpèt, ak vag lanmè ki t ap kase sou kannòt la otan ke kannòt la te prèske fin plen nèt. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Jésus Li menm te nan pwent dèyè kote L t ap dòmi sou yon kousen. Yo te fè L leve e te di Li: “Mèt, èske sa pa fè Ou anyen ke n ap mouri?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Li te leve, e konsa, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 65:7">Sòm 65:7</ref></char></note>reprimande van an e te di a lanmè a: <char style="wj">“Fè silans, rete kalm!” </char> Epi van an te vin bese e tan an te vini byen kalm.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Poukisa nou pè konsa?</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:31">Mat 14:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Jiska prezan, nou poko gen lafwa?” </char><verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Yo te etone avèk laperèz e yo te di: “Ki moun sa ye ke menm van avèk dlo lanmè obeyi Li?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te vini lòtbò lanmè a nan peyi Gadarenyen yo. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Lè Li te fin sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:9">Mc 3:9</ref></char></note>kannòt la, lapoula yon mesye avèk yon move lespri ki sòti nan tonm yo te rankontre Li. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Li t ap viv pami tonm yo, e pèsòn pa t kab mare l ankò, menm avèk yon chèn. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Paske li te konn mare souvant avèk gwo fè avèk chèn nan pye li. Chèn yo te konn vin chire separe nèt pa fòs li, e fè yo te kase an mòso. Pèsòn pa t kab donte l. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Konsa, tout tan, lajounen kon lannwit, pami tonm yo ak nan mòn yo, li t ap kriye fò e t ap blese kò l avèk wòch.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Lè l wè Jésus a distans, li kouri pwoche L pou l bese devan L. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Li te kriye avèk yon vwa fò, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:29">Mat 8:29</ref></char></note>“Kisa m gen avè w Jésus, Fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:28">Luc 8:28</ref></char></note>Bondye Pi Wo a? Mwen sipliye Ou pa Bondye, pa toumante mwen!”<verse eid="MRK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Paske Li t ap di a li menm: <char style="wj">“Sòti nan mesye sa a, ou menm move lespri a!” </char> <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Konsa, Li te mande l: <char style="wj">“Kòman yo rele ou?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Li te di L: “Yo rele m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:53">Mat 26:53</ref></char></note>Lejyon, paske nou anpil.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Li te kòmanse sipliye Li seryezman pou Li pa voye yo deyò peyi a.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Konsa, te gen yon gwo bann kochon ki t ap manje la nan mòn nan. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Tout move lespri yo te sipliye Li e te di: “Voye nou nan kochon yo pou nou kapab antre nan yo”. <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Jésus te bay yo pèmisyon. Konsa nan sòti a, move lespri yo te antre nan kochon yo, e bann nan te kouri desann pant falèz mòn nan, jouk rive nan lanmè. Te gen anviwon de-mil nan yo, e yo te mouri nan dlo lanmè a.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Konsa, gadyen yo te kouri kite lye a, e te bay rapò sa nan vil la, tankou andeyò. E moun yo te vini pou wè sa ki te rive a. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Yo te vin kote Jésus e yo te wè mesye ki te konn gen move lespri a byen chita, byen abiye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:35">Luc 8:35</ref></char></note>avèk tout bon lespri li. Se te menm moun ki te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:9">Mc 5:9</ref></char></note>“Lejyon an”, e yo te vin gen krent. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Konsa, sila ki te wè l yo, te pale ak yo sou jan sa te rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:24">Mat 4:24</ref></char></note>mesye move lespri a, ak tout afè kochon yo. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />E yo te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:34">Mat 8:34</ref></char></note>sipliye L pou L kite landwa sa a.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:38-39">Luc 8:38-39</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pandan Li t ap antre nan kannòt la, mesye ki te gen move lespri a te sipliye L pou l ta kapab ale avèk Li. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Men Li pa t kite L ale, men te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:39">Luc 8:39</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ale lakay moun ou yo e bay yo rapò sou ki gran bagay SENYÈ a te fè pou ou, ak jan Li te fè ou gras.” </char> <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Li te sòti, e te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 66:16">Sòm 66:16</ref></char></note>pwoklame nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:25">Mat 4:25</ref></char></note>Decapolis ki kalite bon bagay Jésus te fè pou li, e tout moun te etone.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Lè Jésus te fin pase lòtbò ankò nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:36">Mc 4:36</ref></char></note>kannòt la, yon gwo foul te rasanble antoure Li. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:1">Mc 4:1</ref></char></note>bò kote lanmè a. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref></char></note>Youn nan ofisye sinagòg yo ki te rele Jaïrus te pwoche. Lè l te wè Li, li te tonbe sou jenou Li. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Li te sipliye Li byen fò e te di: “Tifi mwen an prèt pou mouri. Silvouplè, vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:5">Mc 6:5</ref></char></note>poze men Ou sou Li pou li kapab vin geri e viv.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Epi Li te ale avèk li. Yon gwo foul t ap swiv Li e yo t ap peze L.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Konsa, te gen yon fanm ki te gen yon emoraji pandan douz ane. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />E li te soufri anpil nan men a anpil doktè. Li te depanse tout sa li te posede san rezilta, men li te vin pi mal atò. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Apre li te fin tande koze Jésus a, li te pwoche dèyè Li nan foul la, e te touche vètman Li. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Paske li te reflechi: “Si m sèlman touche rad Li, mwen va geri”. <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Konsa, nan menm moman an, ekoulman san an te vin seche, e fanm nan te santi nan kò l ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:10">Mc 3:10</ref></char></note>maladi a te geri.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Nan menm moman an, Jésus te santi nan Li menm ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:17">Luc 5:17</ref></char></note>pouvwa a te kite L. Li te vire kote foul la e te di: <char style="wj">“Kilès ki te touche vètman Mwen an?” </char><verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Disip Li yo te di L: “Ou wè tout foul sa a k ap peze Ou, e Ou mande: ‘Kilès ki touche M nan?’”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Li te gade toupatou pou wè fanm ki te fè sa a.<verse eid="MRK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Konsa, fanm nan, tou ap tranble avèk lakrent, konsyan de sa ki te rive l la, li te vin tonbe devan Li, e te di Li tout laverite.<verse eid="MRK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Fi,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:22">Mat 9:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">se lafwa ou ki bay ou lasante.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:50">Luc 7:50</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Ale anpè, e resevwa gerizon de maladi ou a”.</char><verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Pandan Li t ap pale, moun yo te rive sòti lakay ofisye sinagòg la. Yo te di l: “Fi ou a gen tan mouri; ou pa bezwen twouble Mèt la ankò”. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:22">Mc 5:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Men Jésus te gen tan tande sa ki t ap pale a, e te di a ofisye sinagòg la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:50">Luc 8:50</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Pa pè ankò; sèlman kwè”.</char><verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Konsa, Li pa t kite pèsòn swiv Li sof ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:1">Mat 17:1</ref></char></note>Pierre, Jacques, ak Jean, frè a Jacques. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:22">Mc 5:22</ref></char></note>te vini lakay ofisye sinagòg la, epi Li te wè yon gwo tènten, ak moun ki t ap kriye fò e rele “anmwey”. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Li antre, e Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Poukisa nou ap fè tout bri sa a, e kriye konsa? Pitit sa a pa mouri, men l ap dòmi”. </char><verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Konsa yo te kòmanse ri sou Li. Men lè Li te fin mete yo tout deyò, Li te pran manman ak papa a pitit la avèk moun pa L yo, e te antre kote pitit la te ye a. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Li te pran pitit la pa men li, e te di li: <char style="wj">“Talita koum” </char> ki vle di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:14">Luc 7:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Tifi, Mwen di ou leve!” </char><verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Lapoula, tifi a te leve e te kòmanse mache. Li te gen douz ane. Tout moun te sezi. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Konsa, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:4">Mat 8:4</ref></char></note>bay yo yon lòd sevè ke pèsòn pa dwe tande afè sa a. Epi Li di yo pou bay tifi a yon bagay pou li manje.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:54-58">Mat 13:54-58</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jésus te kite la. Li te vini nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:16-23">Luc 4:16-23</ref></char></note>pwòp vil pa Li a, e disip Li yo te swiv Li. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Lè Saba a te vin rive, Li te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4:23</ref></char></note>enstwi nan sinagòg la. Anpil moun te tande L. Yo te etone e te di: “Kote nonm sa a twouve bagay sa yo, e se ki sajès sa ke Li resevwa, pou mirak konsa yo ka fèt pa men L?” <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Se pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mat 13:55</ref></char></note>chapant lan, fis Marie a, frè a Jacques, avèk Joses, ak Jude, ak Simon an? Se pa sè Li yo ki avèk nou? E yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:6">Mat 11:6</ref></char></note>ofanse de Li.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Konsa, Jésus te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mat 13:57</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Yon pwofèt pa janm san onè sof ke nan pwòp vil pa L, pami pwòp fanmi li e nan pwòp kay Li.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Li pa t kab fè anpil mirak la, malgre Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:23">Mc 5:23</ref></char></note>poze men Li sou kèk moun malad, e Li te geri yo. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Li te etone pa enkredilite yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Epi Li t ap ale toupatou nan ti bouk yo pou bay enstriksyon.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:35">Mat 9:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luc 10:4-11</ref></char></note> Li te rele douz yo e te kòmanse voye yo sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:1">Luc 10:1</ref></char></note>de pa de, e Li te bay yo otorite sou move lespri yo. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat 10:10</ref></char></note>Konsa, Li te avèti yo ke yo pa t pou pran anyen pou vwayaj la sof ke yon baton; ni pen, ni yon sak, ni lajan pou mete nan senti yo; <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />men yo te gen pou mete sapat yo, e Li te di anplis: <char style="wj">“Pa menm mete de tinik (yon wòb lejè)”. </char><verse eid="MRK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Nenpòt kote nou antre nan yon kay, rete la jouk lè nou kite vil la.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" /><char style="wj">Epi nenpòt kote ki pa resevwa nou, oswa koute nou, pandan nou ap kite la,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mat 10:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">souke retire menm pousyè ki anba pye nou kon temwayaj kont yo. Asireman mwen di ou, l ap pi tolerab pou Sodome ak Gomorrhe nan jou jijman an pase vil sa a!” </char><verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:1">Mat 11:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te sòti deyò e yo t ap preche ke moun dwe repanti. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Yo t ap chase anpil move lespri, yo t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Jc 5:14</ref></char></note>onksyone malad yo avèk lwil, e t ap geri yo.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Wa Hérode te tande de bagay sa yo pwiske non Li te deja vini byen koni. Moun t ap di ke Jean Baptiste te gen tan leve soti nan lanmò, ki fè L vin gen pouvwa pou fè tout mirak sa yo.<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Men lòt t ap di: “Li menm se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat 16:14</ref></char></note>Élie”. Lòt t ap di: “Li se yon pwofèt, kon youn nan ansyen pwofèt yo”.<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Men lè Hérode te tande sa, Li t ap di: “Jean, tèt de sila ke m te fin koupe a, gen tan resisite!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Paske se te Hérode menm ki te voye fè arete Jean, e li te mare l nan prizon pou koz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref></char></note>Hérodias, madanm a frè li a, Philippe, akoz ke li te marye avè l. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Paske Jean t ap di a Hérode: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:4">Mat 14:4</ref></char></note>“Li pa pèmèt pou ou gen madanm a frè ou”. <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Konsa, Hérodias te gen yon kont avèk li, e te vle mete L a lanmò men l pa t kab fè l; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:26">Mat 21:26</ref></char></note>Hérode te pè Jean, pwiske li te konnen ke li te yon nonm ladwati ki sen, e li te pwoteje l. Lè Hérode te konn koute l, li te konn byen twouble; men li te bay li plezi pou koute l.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Men yon jou okazyon an te vin parèt pandan fèt nesans Hérode. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:3">Est 1:3</ref></char></note>ofri yon gwo fèt pou gwo chèf dirijan avèk kòmandan militè yo nan Galilée. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref></char></note>fi a Hérodias la te vini pou kont li e te danse, li te fè Hérode kontan ak tout vizitè li yo nan fèt la. Konsa Wa a te di fi a: “Mande mwen nenpòt sa ou vle, e m ap bay ou li”. <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Li te sèmante a li menm: “Nenpòt sa ou vle, m ap bay ou li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:3-6">Est 5:3-6</ref></char></note>jiska mwatye wayòm mwen an”.<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Konsa, li te ale deyò e te mande manman l: “Kisa mwen dwe mande?” Epi li te di l: “Tèt a Jean Baptiste”.<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Lapoula, li te vini avèk vitès devan Wa a avèk yon demann. Li te di: “Mwen vle ke ou ban mwen koulye a menm, tèt a Jean Baptiste sou yon plato”.<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Malgre ke Wa a te byen tris akoz sèman an, men akoz vizitè li yo, li pa t gen kouraj pou l refize l. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Imedyatman Wa a te voye yon gad avèk lòd pou vini avèk tèt li. Li te ale, e te fè yo koupe tèt li nan prizon an. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Konsa yo te pote tèt li sou yon plato pou te bay fi a, e fi a te bay li a manman l.<verse eid="MRK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Lè disip li yo te tande sa, yo te vin pran kò l, e te mete l nan yon tonm.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:2">Mat 10:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Apòt yo te rasanble avèk Jésus. Yo te bay Li yon rapò de tout sa yo te fè ak sa yo te enstwi.<verse eid="MRK 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Vini apa pou kont nou nan yon plas apa pou pran yon ti repo”. </char>Paske anpil moun t ap antre, sòti, e yo pa t menm gen tan manje.<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 8:2-9">Mc 8:2-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te kite la nan yon kannòt pou ale nan yon plas apa pou kont yo. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Konsa, lè pèp la te wè ke yo t ap prale, anpil moun te rekonèt yo. Yo te kouri jwenn yo apye, sòti nan tout vil yo, epi yo te rive avan yo.<verse eid="MRK 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Lè Jésus te rive atè, Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9:36</ref></char></note>te wè yon gwo foul. Konsa, Li te gen konpasyon pou yo paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Nonb 27:17</ref></char></note>yo te tankou mouton san gadò. Li te kòmanse enstwi yo anpil bagay.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Lè li te deja byen ta, disip Li yo te vin kote Li. Yo te di: “Plas sa a byen izole, e li deja fin byen ta. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Voye yo ale pou yo kapab ale nan landwa pa yo avèk vil pa yo pou achte kèk manje pou tèt yo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Men Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Nou menm bay yo manje!” </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:7">Jn 6:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Yo te reponn Li: “Ou vle nou ale depanse de-san denye nan pen pou nou bay yo manje?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Konbyen pen nou genyen? Al gade!” </char> Lè yo konnen, yo di: “Senk pen ak de pwason”.<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Konsa, Li te kòmande yo pou chita pa gwoup nan zèb vèt la. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Yo te chita pa gwoup de santèn, e pa gwoup de senkantèn. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Li te pran senk pen yo avèk de pwason yo. Li te gade vè syèl la, e Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:9">Mat 14:9</ref></char></note>beni manje a. Li te kase pen yo, e Li te kontinye bay disip yo pou mete devan yo. Li te divize bay nan de pwason yo pami yo tout.<verse eid="MRK 6:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Yo tout te manje, e yo te satisfè. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Yo te ranmase douz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:21">Mat 14:21</ref></char></note>panyen byen plen avèk moso kase yo; e anplis, pwason. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:21">Mat 14:21</ref></char></note>senk-mil mesye ki te manje pen yo.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:22-32">Mat 14:22-32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, Jésus te fè disip Li yo antre nan kannòt la pou ale devan Li lòtbò vè Bethsaïda, pandan Li menm t ap voye foul la ale. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Lè Li fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:18-21">Trav 18:18-21</ref></char></note>di yo orevwa, Li te ale nan mòn nan pou priye.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Lè lannwit te rive, kannòt la te nan mitan lanmè a, e Jésus te atè pou kont Li. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Lè L te wè yo t ap fè fòs sou zaviwon yo akoz van an te kont yo, nan anviwon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat 24:43</ref></char></note>katriyèm è nan aswè, Li te vin kote yo ap mache sou lanmè a, kòmsi Li te gen entansyon ale devan pou kite yo dèyè.<verse eid="MRK 6:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Men lè yo te wè L ap mache sou lanmè a, yo te sipoze ke Li te yon fantom e yo te kriye fò; <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />pwiske yo tout te wè Li e yo te pè. Men nan moman sa a Li te pale avèk yo. Li te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:2">Mat 9:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Pran kouraj! Se Mwen menm!</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:27">Mat 14:27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Pa pè.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Li te antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:32">Mc 6:32</ref></char></note>nan kannòt la avèk yo, e van an te sispann. Yo te vrèman sezi. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Akoz yo pa t reyisi gen okenn konprann nan afè pen yo, kè yo te di.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:52">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:52 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 8:17">Mc 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:7">Wo 11:7</ref></char>
    </note> <verse eid="MRK 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:24">Jn 6:24</ref></char></note>Lè yo te fin travèse lòtbò, yo te rive atè nan Génésareth e te mare kannòt la atè. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Nan moman yo te kite kannòt la, pèp la te rekonèt yo. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Konsa, pèp la te kouri toupatou nan tout peyi a, e te kòmanse pote sila ki te malad yo sou palèt nan plas kote Li te ye a.<verse eid="MRK 6:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Nenpòt kote Li te antre nan bouk ak gran vil oswa andeyò, yo t ap vin depoze moun malad nan mache yo pou sipliye L pou yo ta kapab sèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:10">Mc 3:10</ref></char></note>touche <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:20">Mat 9:20</ref></char></note>rebò vètman Li, akoz tout moun ki te touche l t ap vin geri.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:1-20">Mat 15:1-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Farizyen yo avèk kèk nan skrib yo te antoure Jésus lè yo te sòti Jérusalem. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Lè yo te wè ke kèk nan disip Li yo t ap manje pen avèk men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:2">Mat 15:2</ref></char></note>enpi, sa vle di, san lave, <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(pwiske Farizyen yo avèk tout Jwif yo pa manje sof ke yo lave men yo kòrèk, pou obsève <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:5">Mc 7:5</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 7:8">8</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 7:9">9</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 7:13">13</ref></char></note>tradisyon a ansyen yo. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Lè yo sòti nan mache, yo pa manje sof ke yo gen tan benyen. Anplis yo gen anpil lòt bagay ke yo konn resevwa kon prensip, tankou lavaj a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:25">Mat 23:25</ref></char></note>tas, avèk krich, ak po kwiv yo.)<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Pou sa, Farizyen yo ak skrib yo te mande L: “Poukisa disip ou yo pa mache selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:3">Mc 7:3</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 7:8">8</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 7:9">9</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 7:13">13</ref></char></note>tradisyon ansyen yo, men manje pen avèk men ki pa lave?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Li te reponn yo: <char style="wj">“Byen jis Ésaïe te fè pwofesi sou nou kom ipokrit, lè li te ekri:</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">És 29:13</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">‘Pèp sa bay Mwen lonè avèk lèv yo, men kè yo lwen Mwen.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">És 29:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Men anven yo adore Mwen lè y ap enstwi kòm doktrin, prensip a lòm.’ </char><verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />
    <char style="wj">“Nou neglije kòmandman a Bondye yo, pou kenbe tradisyon a lòm yo—kon lavaj krich yo ak anpil lòt bagay” </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:3">Mc 7:3</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 7:5">5</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 7:9">9</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 7:13">13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Li t ap di yo anplis: <char style="wj">“ Ak konesans nou mete kòmandman Bondye a akote, pou kenbe tradisyon pa nou yo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" /><char style="wj">Paske Moïse te di: </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Egz 20:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Onore papa ou avèk manman ou’; epi </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:17">Egz 21:17</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘sila ki pale mal a papa li oswa manman li, fòk li mete a lanmò.’</char><verse eid="MRK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />
    <char style="wj">“Men nou di: ‘Si yon nonm di a papa l, ni a manman l, nenpòt sa ke m genyen se</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 1:2">Lev 1:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Kòba’”</char> (sa vle di, “bay a Bondye”), <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" /><char style="wj">“Nou pa pèmèt moun nan fè anyen ankò ni pou papa l, ni pou manman l.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" /><char style="wj">Konsa nou fè pawòl Bondye a vin nil ak</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:3-9">Mc 7:3-9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">tradisyon ke nou transmèt a youn lòt. Nou fè anpil bagay konsa.” </char><verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Li te rele foul la kote Li ankò. Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Koute Mwen, nou tout, e konprann:</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" /><char style="wj">Nanpwen anyen deyò yon nonm k ap fè l sal, men se bagay ki sòti pa anndan yon nonm ki fè l sal.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" /><char style="wj">Si yon moun gen zòrèy, kite li tande.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Lè Li te kite foul la, Li te antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 2:1">Mc 2:1</ref></char></note>nan kay la. Disip Li yo te kesyone L sou parabòl sila a.<verse eid="MRK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Epi Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Èske nou si tèlman manke konprann tou? Èske nou pa konprann ke sa ki sòti deyò yon nonm pou antre ladann pa kapab souye l,</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" /><char style="wj">paske sa pa antre nan kè l, men nan vant li epi li vin elimine?” </char> (Konsa Li te deklare ke tout kalite manje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 11:41">Luc 11:41</ref></char></note>pwòp.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:18">Mat 15:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Sa ki sòti nan yon moun, se sa ki souye l.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" /><char style="wj">Paske pa anndan, sòti nan kè lòm tout move panse, fònikasyon, vòl, touye moun, adiltè,</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" /><char style="wj">zak lanvi sa ki pou lòt, mechanste, desepsyon, sansyalite,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:23">Mat 6:23</ref></char></note><char style="wj">jalouzi, kout lang, ògèy, ak tout kalite foli.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" /><char style="wj">Tout mal sa yo sòti pa anndan, epi souye yon nonm.” </char><verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15:21-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jésus te leve e te pati pou rejyon Tyr la. Lè Li te antre nan yon kay, Li pa t vle pèsòn konnen sa, men Li pa t kab evite atire atansyon.<verse eid="MRK 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Men lè yon fanm ak yon tifi ki te gen yon move lespri te tande de Jésus, li te vin kote L nan menm moman an, e te tonbe nan pye Li. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Alò, fanm sila a te yon moun etranje nan ras Siwofonisyèn. E li te kontinye mande L pou chase move lespri a sou pitit li a.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Kite zanfan yo satisfè avan, paske li pa bon pou pran pen timoun yo pou jete l bay chen.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Men fanm nan te reponn Li: “Wi Mèt, men menm ti chen anba tab yo manje ti moso ke timoun yo lese tonbe yo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Konsa Li te di li: <char style="wj">“Akoz repons sa a, al fè wout ou; move lespri a gen tan kite fi ou a.” </char><verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />E lè fanm nan te retounen lakay li, li te twouve tifi a byen kouche sou kabann nan, e move lespri a te gen tan kite li.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:29-31">Mat 15:29-31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ankò Li te kite rejyon Tyr la, e te pase pa Sidon jiska lanmè Galilée a, nan rejyon Decapolis.<verse eid="MRK 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Yo te mennen bay Li yon moun ki te soud, ki te pale avèk anpil difikilte, e yo te sipliye L pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:23">Mc 5:23</ref></char></note>mete men Li sou li.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 8:23">Mc 8:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jésus te mennen l apa gran foul la, e te mete dwat Li anndan zòrèy moun nan. Li te krache, e te touche lang li avèk krache a. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Pandan Li gade vè syèl la, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mc 8:12</ref></char></note>soupire byen fò, e te di li: <char style="wj">“Ifafata!” </char> Sa vle di <char style="wj">“Ouvri!” </char> <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Konsa zòrèy li te louvri. Lang lou a te disparèt, e li te vin pale kon nòmal.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Li te bay yo lòd pou yo pa pale avèk pèsòn; men plis Li te bay lòd, plis yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:45">Mc 1:45</ref></char></note>kontinye gaye nouvèl la toupatou. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Yo te vin etone nèt. Yo t ap di: “Li fè tout bagay byen. Li fè menm soud yo tande, e bèbè yo pale”.<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Nan jou sa yo, lè te gen ankò yon gwo foul ki pa t gen anyen pou yo manje, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:34-44">Mc 6:34-44</ref></char></note>Jésus te rele disip Li yo. Li te di yo: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:36">Mc 9:36</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Mwen santi konpasyon pou foul la pwiske yo rete avèk Mwen koulye a pandan twa jou, e yo pa gen anyen pou yo manje.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" /><char style="wj">Si Mwen voye yo lakay yo grangou, y ap fennen nan wout la, e gen nan yo ki sòti yon bon distans.” </char><verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Disip Li yo te reponn Li: “Kote yon moun kapab jwenn ase pen isit la pou satisfè moun sa yo nan yon andwa izole konsa”?<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Li te mande yo: <char style="wj">“Konbyen moso pen nou genyen?”</char> Yo te di Li: “Sèt”.<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Konsa, Li te fè yo chita atè. Li te pran sèt pen yo, e te kase yo an mòso. Li te kòmanse bay yo a disip Li yo pou sèvi yo, e yo te bay yo a foul la. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Anplis yo te genyen kèk ti pwason. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:19">Mat 14:19</ref></char></note>Lè L fin beni yo, Li te kòmande sa yo anplis pou separe bay.<verse eid="MRK 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Yo te manje e yo te satisfè. Yo te ranmase sèt gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:37">Mat 15:37</ref></char></note>panyen plen avèk moso kase ki te rete. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Te gen anviwon kat mil ki te la. Konsa, Li te voye yo ale. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Nan menm moman sa a, Li te antre nan kannòt la avèk disip Li yo, pou te rive nan peyi yo rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:39">Mat 15:39</ref></char></note>Dalmanutha a.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:1-12">Mat 16:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12:38</ref></char>
    </note>Farizyen yo te parèt e yo te kòmanse diskite avè L. Yo te mande L yon sign ki sòti nan syèl la pou teste li.<verse eid="MRK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Avèk yon gwo soupi ki sòti nan lespri Li, Li te di: “Poukisa jenerasyon sila a ap chèche yon sign? Anverite Mwen di nou: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mat 12:39</ref></char></note>Nanpwen sign k ap parèt a jenerasyon sila a.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Lè L fin kite yo, Li te monte kannòt la pou te ale lòtbò.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Yo te bliye pran pen, e pa t gen plis ke yon moso nan kannòt la avèk yo.<verse eid="MRK 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Li te avèti yo pou di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mat 16:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Veye byen! Fè atansyon kont ledven Farizyen yo, ak ledven Hérode la!” </char><verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Konsa, yo te kòmanse diskite youn avèk lòt pwoblèm ke yo pa t gen pen an.<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Jésus te konprann sa byen, e te di yo: <char style="wj">“Poukisa nou ap pale afè pen an? </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:52">Mc 6:52</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Èske nou poko wè ni konprann? Èske nou gen kè di?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:21">Jr 5:21</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Malgre nou gen zye, èske nou pa wè? E malgre nou gen zòrèy, èske nou pa tande? E èske nou pa sonje </char> <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" /><char style="wj">lè Mwen te kase</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:41-44">Mc 6:41-44</ref></char></note><char style="wj">senk pen yo pou senk mil moun, konbyen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:20">Mat 14:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">panyen plen avèk moso kase nou te ranmase?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Yo te di Li: “Douz”.<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />
    <char style="wj">“Epi lè Mwen te kase</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:6-9">Mc 8:6-9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sèt pou kat mil moun yo, konbyen gwo panyen plen avèk moso kase nou te ranmase?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Yo te di li: “Sèt”.<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Li te mande yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:52">Mc 6:52</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Èske nou poko menm konprann?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yo te rive Bethsaïda. Moun yo te pote bay Li yon mesye avèg e yo te sipliye L pou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:10">Mc 3:10</ref></char></note>touche l.<verse eid="MRK 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />An pran mesye avèg la pa men li, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:33">Mc 7:33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:23">Mc 5:23</ref></char></note>mennen l sòti nan vil la. Lè L fin krache sou zye li e mete men L sou li, Li te mande l: <char style="wj">“Èske ou pa wè anyen?” </char><verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Konsa, li te leve tèt li gade e te di: “Mwen wè moun. Konsi mwen wè yo tankou pyebwa k ap mache toupatou.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Ankò Li te mete men Li sou zye li. Li te gade byen fiks, e li te vin restore. Konsa, li te wè tout bagay byen klè.<verse eid="MRK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Li te voye li lakay li e te di: <char style="wj">“Pa menm antre</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:23">Mc 8:23</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nan vil la.” </char><verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Jésus te sòti avèk disip Li yo pou lantre nan vilaj Césarée <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:13-16">Mat 16:13-16</ref></char></note>Philippe. Sou wout la Li te diskite ak disip Li yo. Li te mande yo: <char style="wj">“Kilès moun yo di ke Mwen ye?” </char><verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Yo te di Li: “Jean Baptiste, e kèk lòt Élie, men lòt, youn nan pwofèt yo”.<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Li te kesyone yo plis; <char style="wj">“Men kilès nou menm nou di ke Mwen ye?” </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68-69">Jn 6:68-69</ref></char></note>Pierre te reponn e te di Li: “Ou menm se Kris la.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:4">Mat 8:4</ref></char></note>Li te avèti yo pou pa di pèsòn anyen sou Li menm.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16:21-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te kòmanse enstwi yo ke Fis a Lòm nan t ap oblije soufri anpil bagay, vin rechte pa ansyen yo avèk chèf prèt ak skrib yo, e touye. E apre twa jou, Li ta resisite ankò. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Li t ap pale bagay la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:24">Jn 10:24</ref></char></note>byen klè.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:32">Konsa, Pierre te mennen L akote e te kòmanse repwoche L.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Men lè l te vire gade dèyè, Li te wè disip Li yo, e Li te repwoche Pierre, e te di l: <char style="wj">“Mete ou dèyè M, </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:10">Mat 4:10</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Satan! Paske ou p ap mete panse ou sou enterè Bondye a, men enterè lòm.” </char><verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Li te rele foul la avèk disip Li yo. Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Si yon moun vle swiv Mwen, fòk li renonse pwòp tèt li, </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pran kwa li, e swiv Mwen.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" /><char style="wj">Paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nenpòt moun ki vle sove vi li, va pèdi li; men nenpòt moun ki pèdi vi li akoz Mwen ak levanjil la, ap sove li.</char><verse eid="MRK 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />
    <char style="wj">“Paske kisa sa sèvi a yon nonm si l genyen tou lemonn men l pèdi nanm li?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" /><char style="wj">Paske kisa yon nonm ap bay an echanj pou nanm Li.</char><verse eid="MRK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />
    <char style="wj">“Paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:33">Mat 10:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nenpòt moun ki wont de Mwen menm avèk pawòl Mwen, nan jenerasyon adiltè e konwonpi sila a, Fis a Lòm nan ap wont de li menm tou lè Li vini nan glwa a Papa Li avèk zanj sen yo.” </char><verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Jésus te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:28">Mat 16:28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Anverite Mwen di nou, gen kèk moun nan sila ki kanpe la yo ki p ap goute lanmò jouk lè yo fin wè wayòm Bondye a rive avèk pouvwa.” </char><verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17:1-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sis jou pita, Jésus te pran avè L, Pierre, Jacques, avèk Jean, e te mennen yo sou yon mòn wo pou kont yo. La, devan yo, Li te transfòme nan yon lòt fòm. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:3">Mat 28:3</ref></char></note>Rad Li yo te vin klere jis yo blanchi nèt, blanch kon okenn moun k ap fè lesiv nan mond sa a, pa t janm kab fè. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Konsa, Élie ak Moïse te parèt devan yo ansanm, e yo t ap pale avèk Jésus.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Pierre te reponn pou di Jésus: “Mèt, se bon pou nou isit la; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:4">Mat 17:4</ref></char></note>annou fè twa tabènak, youn pou Ou, youn pou Moïse, e youn pou Élie.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Paske li pa t konnen ki repons pou bay, akoz kè yo te plen avèk laperèz.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Konsa, yon nwaj te fòme ki te vin mete yo nan fon lonbraj, e yon vwa te vin sòti nan nwaj la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref></char></note>“Sa se Fis Mwen; koute Li!”<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Nan menm moman sa a, yo te gade toupatou e pa t wè pèsòn avèk yo ankò, sof ke Jésus sèl.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 17:9-13">Mat 17:9-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pandan yo t ap desann mòn nan, Li te bay yo lòd pou pa di pèsòn sa yo te wè a, jouk lè ke Fis a Lòm nan ta leve soti nan lanmò. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Yo te reflechi anpil sou pawòl sa a, e te diskite youn avèk lòt sou sa sa vle di: “leve soti nan lanmò an”.<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Yo te mande Li: “Poukisa skrib yo di ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref></char></note>Élie oblije vini avan an?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Élie vrèman ap vini avan pou restore tout bagay. Men poukisa li ekri sou Fis a Lòm nan ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat 16:21</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Li va soufri anpil bagay, e vin meprize?</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" /><char style="wj">Men Mwen di nou Élie vrèman gen tan vini, e yo te fè l sa ke yo te pito, jan ke sa ekri sou li a.” </char><verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 17:14-19">Mat 17:14-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè yo te retounen kote disip yo, yo te wè yon gwo foul ki te antoure yo, e kèk skrib ki t ap diskite avèk yo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Imedyatman, lè tout foul la te wè Li, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:33">Mc 14:33</ref></char></note>etone, e yo te kouri vini salye Li.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />E Li te mande yo: <char style="wj">“Kisa nou ap diskite avèk yo la a?” </char><verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Epi yon moun nan foul la te reponn Li: “Mèt, mwen te pote bay Ou fis Mwen an, ki gen yon move lespri ki fè l bèbè; <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />epi lè li sezi l, li voye li atè. Li kimen nan bouch e manje dan l; kò li vin tou rèd. Mwen te pale disip Ou yo pou chase l, men yo pa t kapab.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Konsa, Li te reponn yo e te di: <char style="wj">“O jenerasyon enkredil, pou konbyen de tan ankò M ap avèk nou? Konbyen de tan ankò M ap sipòte nou? Fè l vin kote Mwen!” </char><verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Yo te pote gason an kote Li. E lè li te wè L, lapoula lespri a te jete li nan yon gwo kriz. Li te tonbe atè, te kòmanse woule toupatou e kimen nan bouch.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Jésus te mande papa li: <char style="wj">“Depi kilè bagay sa a konn rive li?” </char> Li te di: “Depi li timoun. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Souvan li konn voye li ni nan dlo, ni nan dife pou l detwi l. Men si Ou kapab fè yon bagay, gen pitye pou nou, e ede nou!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Si Ou kapab?</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Tout bagay posib pou sila a ki kwè a.” </char><verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Konsa, papa a tigason an te kriye fò e te di: “Mwen kwè; ede enkredilite Mwen an.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Lè Jésus te wè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:15">Mc 9:15</ref></char></note>foul moun t ap rasanble, Li te reprimande move lespri a. Li te di L: <char style="wj">“Ou menm lespri soud e bèbè, Mwen kòmande ou, sòti nan li, e pa antre nan li ankò.” </char><verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Lè lespri a fin kriye fò, e jete li nan gwo kriz tèrib, li te sòti. Ti gason an te tèlman parèt kon yon kadav, ki te fè pi fò nan yo te di: “Li mouri!”<verse eid="MRK 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Men Jésus te pran li pa men li, te leve l, e Li te kanpe.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Lè Li te vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 2:1">Mc 2:1</ref></char></note>nan kay la, disip Li yo te kòmanse kesyone Li an prive: “Poukisa nou pa t kapab chase l?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Kalite sila a p ap kab sòti pa anyen, sof ke lapriyè.” </char><verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Depi la yo te ale pase nan tout Galilée, e Li pa t vle ke pèsòn konnen anyen sou sa. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Paske Li t ap enstwi disip Li yo e t ap di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat 16:21</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Fis a Lòm nan va livre nan men a lèzòm, e yo va touye Li. Epi lè Li fin touye, L ap resisite ankò twa jou pita.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:50">Luc 2:50</ref></char></note>yo pa t konprann pawòl sila a, e yo te pè mande L.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te vini Capernaüm, e lè Li te nan kay la, Li te kòmanse kesyone yo: <char style="wj">“De kisa nou t ap diskite nan wout la?” </char> <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Men yo te rete an silans; paske nan wout la, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:4">Mat 18:4</ref></char></note>t ap diskite de kilès nan yo ki te pi gran.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Lè Li te fin chita, Li te rele douz yo, e Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Mat 20:26</ref></char></note>di yo: <char style="wj">“Si yon moun vle premye, li va dènye de tout moun, e vin sèvitè a tout moun.” </char><verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Li te pran yon timoun, e te fè l chita devan yo. Epi lè L pran li nan bra Li, Li te di yo: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Nenpòt moun ki resevwa yon timoun tankou sila a nan non pa M, resevwa M; e nenpòt moun ki resevwa M, li pa resevwa Mwen, men Sila ki voye Mwen an.” </char><verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luc 9:49-50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jean te di Li: “Mèt, nou te wè yon moun ki t ap chase move lespri yo nan non Ou, e nou te eseye fè l sispann, paske li pa t ap swiv nou.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Men Jésus te di: <char style="wj">“Pa anpeche li, paske pa gen moun k ap fè yon mirak nan non Mwen, e apre byen vit ki ka pale mal de Mwen.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mat 12:30</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Paske sila ki pa kont nou an, li pou nou.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" /><char style="wj">Paske nenpòt moun ki bay nou yon tas dlo pou bwè akoz nou nan Kris yo, anverite Mwen di nou, li p ap pèdi rekonpans li.</char><verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:6">Mat 18:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Nenpòt moun ki fè youn nan pitit sa yo ki kwè vin chape tonbe, li t ap pi bon pou li si yo te mete yon gwo wòch moulen nan kou li, e jete l nan lanmè.</char><verse eid="MRK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:3">Mat 5:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:12">Mat 3:12</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Si men nou fè nou chape tonbe, koupe l nèt; li pi bon pou nou ta antre nan lavi kokobe, pase avèk de men, pou nou ta jete nan twou san fon an, nan lanfè ki “pa kapab etenn nan, </char> <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" /><char style="wj">‘kote vè pa mouri, e dife pa janm etenn.’</char><verse eid="MRK 9:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />
    <char style="wj">“E si pye nou fè nou chape tonbe, koupe li nèt; li pi bon pou nou antre nan lavi bwete, pase genyen tou de pye nou, e vin jete nan</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:22">Mat 5:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">lanfè,</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" /><char style="wj">kote vè pa mouri, e dife pa janm etenn. </char><verse eid="MRK 9:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mat 5:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Si zye nou fè nou chape tonbe, retire li jete; li pi bon pou nou antre nan wayòm Bondye a avèk yon sèl zye, pase jete nan lanfè avèk de zye. </char> <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" /><char style="wj">Kote vè pa mouri, e dife pa janm etenn.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:48">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:24">És 66:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:12">Mat 3:12</ref></char>
    </note> <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" /><char style="wj">“Paske tout moun va vin sale ak dife, e chak sakrifis ap sizonnen ak sèl. </char><verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />
    <char style="wj">“Disèl la bon, men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">si disèl la vin pèdi gou, kilès k ap fè l gen gou sèl ankò. Fòk nou gen sèl nan nou, e rete anpè youn avèk lòt.” </char><verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:1-9">Mat 19:1-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè l leve, Li te kite la pou landwa Juda a, ak lòtbò Jourdain an. Foul yo te antoure Li ankò, e selon koutim Li, Li te kòmanse enstwi yo ankò.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Kèk Farizyen te vin kote L pou sonde L, e te kesyone L pou si li te pèmi pou yon mesye divòse ak madanm li.<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Konsa, Li te reponn li e te di: <char style="wj">“Kisa Moïse te kòmande nou?” </char><verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1-3">Det 24:1-3</ref></char></note>“Moïse te bay dwa pou yon mesye ekri yon sètifika pou l divòse ak li, epi voye l ale.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Men Jésus te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:8">Mat 19:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Akoz kè di nou, li te ekri nou kòmandman sa a.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" /><char style="wj">Men </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:19">Mc 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 1:27">Jen 1:27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">depi kòmansman kreyasyon an, Bondye te fè yo mal ak femèl.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" /><char style="wj">Pou rezon sa a, yon gason va kite papa li ak manman li,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Jen 2:24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">epi yo de a ap vin fè yon sèl chè. An konsekans, se pa de yo ye ankò, men yon sèl chè.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" /><char style="wj">Pou rezon sa a, sa ke Bondye gen tan lye ansanm, pa kite okenn moun separe l.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Anndan kay la, disip yo te kesyone Li ankò. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />E Li te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5:32</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Nenpòt moun ki divòse ak madanm li pou marye avèk yon lòt fanm, fè adiltè kont li.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" /><char style="wj">E si </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:11">I Kor 7:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">fanm nan divòse ak mari li e marye avèk yon lòt, li menm tou fè adiltè.” </char><verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa yo t ap pote timoun bay li pou L ta kapab touche yo, e disip yo te reprimande yo.<verse eid="MRK 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Men lè Jésus te wè sa, Li te mekontan e te di yo: <char style="wj">“Kite timoun yo vini kote Mwen; pa anpeche yo,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:3">Mat 5:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">paske wayòm Bondye a se pou sila ki tankou sa yo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" /><char style="wj">Anverite Mwen di nou:</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mat 18:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nenpòt moun ki pa resevwa wayòm Bondye a kon yon timoun, li p ap antre li menm.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Epi li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:36">Mc 9:36</ref></char></note>pran yo nan bra Li, te beni yo, e te poze men L sou yo.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pandan Li t ap prepare pou yon vwayaj, yon nonm te kouri kote L, te mete l ajenou devan Li. Li te mande L: “Bon Mèt, kisa mwen dwe fè pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:34">Mat 25:34</ref></char></note>eritye lavi etènèl?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Epi Jésus te di Li: <char style="wj">“Poukisa ou rele M bon? Nanpwen moun ki bon sof ke Bondye sèl.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" /><char style="wj">Ou konnen kòmandman yo, </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Egz 20:12-16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Pa touye moun, pa fè adiltè, pa vòlè, pa fè fo temwayaj, pa twonpe moun, onore papa ou avèk manman ou’.” </char><verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Konsa li te di Li: “Mèt, mwen fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:20">Mat 19:20</ref></char></note>tout bagay sa yo depi mwen timoun.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Jésus te byen gade li. Li te gen yon lanmou pou li. Li te di l: <char style="wj">“Yon bagay ou manke; ale vann tout sa ou posede, bay malere yo, e ou va gen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:20">Mat 6:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">richès nan syèl la. E konsa, vin swiv Mwen.” </char><verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Men avèk pawòl sa yo, li te vin atriste. Li te kite lye sa a, byen dezole, paske li te yon moun ki te gen anpil byen.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Jésus te gade toupatou e te di a disip li yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:23">Mat 19:23</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Ala sa ap difisil pou sila ki gen anpil richès antre nan wayòm Bondye a!” </char><verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Disip Li yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:27">Mc 1:27</ref></char></note>etone de pawòl Li yo. Men Jésus te reponn yo ankò e te di yo: <char style="wj">“Zanfan yo, ala sa difisil pou antre nan wayòm Bondye a!</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:24">Mat 19:24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">L ap pi fasil pou yon chamo pase nan zye a yon egwi, pase pou yon moun rich antre nan wayòm Bondye a.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Yo te menm pi etone. Yo te di l: “Ebyen, kilès ki kab sove?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Tou ap gade yo Jésus te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:26">Mat 19:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Avèk moun, sa pa posib, men li pa konsa avèk Bondye. Paske tout bagay posib avèk Bondye.” </char><verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:20-22">Mat 4:20-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pierre te kòmanse di L: “Gade, nou gen tan kite tout bagay e te swiv Ou.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Jésus te di: <char style="wj">“Anverite Mwen di nou,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:33">Mat 6:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Nanpwen pèsòn ki kite kay li, oswa frè li, oswa sè li ak pitit li, ni manman ni papa, oswa jaden li pou koz Mwen ak pou koz levanjil la,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" /><char style="wj">men ke l ap resevwa san fwa plis koulye a, nan tan sila a, kay, frè, sè ansanm avèk pèsekisyon yo; e</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mat 12:32</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nan laj k ap vini an, lavi etènèl.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" /><char style="wj">Men</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:3">Mat 19:3</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">anpil moun ki premye ap vin dènye; e dènye yo va vin premye.</char><verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te sou wout la pou ale Jérusalem e Jésus t ap mache pi devan yo. Yo te etone, e sila ki te swiv yo te pè anpil.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:32">Ankò Li te rele douz yo akote e te kòmanse di yo kisa ki ta vin rive Li.<verse eid="MRK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />
    <char style="wj">“Byen gade, nou ap monte Jérusalem. </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mc 8:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Fis a Lòm nan va livre a chèf prèt yo avèk skrib yo. Yo va kondane Li a lanmò, e yo va livre li a payen yo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" /><char style="wj">Epi y ap moke L,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat 16:21</ref></char></note><char style="wj">krache sou Li, bay Li gwo kout fwèt, e touye L. Twa jou pita, L ap resisite.” </char><verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20:20-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jacques, Jean, avèk de fis Zébédée yo te vin kote L. Yo te di L: “Mèt, nou vle ke Ou fè pou nou nenpòt sa ke nou mande Ou”.<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Kisa nou vle M fè pou nou”? </char><verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Yo te di L: “Bannou dwa pou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat 19:28</ref></char></note>kapab chita nan glwa Ou, youn sou bò dwat Ou, e youn sou bò gòch Ou nan glwa Ou.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Men Jésus te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:22">Mat 20:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Nou pa konnen sa n ap mande a. Èske nou kapab bwè tas ke M ap bwè a, oubyen batize avèk batèm ke Mwen ap batize a?” </char><verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Yo te di L: “Nou kapab”. Jésus te reponn yo: <char style="wj">“Tas ke M ap bwè a, </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:2">Trav 12:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nou ap bwè. Epi nou ap batize avèk menm batèm ke M ap batize a.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" /><char style="wj">Men pou chita bò dwat Mwen, oubyen bò gòch Mwen an, sila a se pa pa M nan pou M ta bay,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:11">Mat 13:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">men se pou sila ke li te prepare yo.” </char><verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 10:42-45">Mc 10:42-45</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè yo tande sa, dis lòt yo te kòmanse santi ke yo te mekontan avèk Jacques ak Jean.<verse eid="MRK 10:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Konsa, Jésus te rele yo a Li menm. Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Nou konnen ke sila ki rekonèt kon chèf pami payen yo domine sou yo, epi gwo chèf yo egzèse otorite sou yo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" /><char style="wj">Men li pa konsa pami nou menm,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Mat 20:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">men nenpòt moun ki vle vin gran pami nou, va sèvi nou.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" /><char style="wj">Nenpòt moun ki vle premye pami nou, va vin esklav a nou tout.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" /><char style="wj">Paske menm Fis a Lòm nan</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:28">Mat 20:28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pa t vin pou yo sèvi Li, men pou bay vi li kon yon ranson pou anpil lòt.” </char><verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa yo te rive Jéricho. E pandan Li t ap kite Jéricho avèk disip Li yo, ansanm ak yon gwo foul la, yon avèg ki t ap mande, ki te rele Bartimée, fis a Timée, te chita akote wout la. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Lè l tande ke se te Jésus, Nazareyen an, li te kòmanse kriye fò e te di: “Jésus, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:27">Mat 9:27</ref></char></note>Fis a David la, gen pitye pou mwen!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Konsa, anpil moun t ap pale ak li sevèman pou li ta pe la, men li te kriye pi fò: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:27">Mat 9:27</ref></char></note>“Fis a David la: gen pitye pou mwen!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Konsa, Jésus te rete la, e te di: <char style="wj">“Rele Li.” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Yo te rele avèg la. Yo te di l: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:2">Mat 9:2</ref></char></note>“Pran kouraj! Leve kanpe! L ap rele ou!” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Li te jete akote gwo vètman li, te vòltije kanpe byen vit, e te rive kote Jésus.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Jésus te reponn li, e te di l: <char style="wj">“Kisa ou vle M fè pou ou?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Mesye avèg la te di L: “Rabouni (ki vle di Mèt), mwen vle wè ankò!” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:7">Mat 23:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Jésus te di l: <char style="wj">“Ale! Lafwa ou fè ou geri.” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Lapoula, li te wè ankò, e li t ap swiv Li sou wout la.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:1-9">Mat 21:1-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pandan yo t ap pwoche Jérusalem, nan Bethphagé avèk Béthanie, toupre mòn Oliv la, Li te bay komisyon a de nan disip Li yo. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Ale nan bouk ki anfas nou an. Pandan n ap antre, nou ap twouve yon ti bourik mare, ki poko menm monte. Demare li e mennen l isit la.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" /><char style="wj">Si yon moun di nou: ‘Poukisa n ap fè sa?’, di l: ‘Senyè a gen bezwen li’. Konsa, l ap voye l vini isit la.”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Yo te ale, e te twouve yon ti bourik mare toupre pòt la, deyò nan lari a, e yo te demare li.<verse eid="MRK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Konsa, kèk nan sila ki te la yo t ap di yo: “Kisa nou ap fè la a? N ap demare ti bourik la?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Yo te pale yo jan Jésus te di a, e yo te bay yo dwa pran l.<verse eid="MRK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:4-9">Mat 21:4-9</ref></char></note>pote ti bourik la bay Jésus. Yo te mete vètman yo sou li, e Li te chita sou li.<verse eid="MRK 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Konsa, anpil moun te tann vètman yo sou wout la, e lòt t ap poze branch fèy yo te koupe nan chan sou wout la. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Sila ki te ale devan yo ak sila ki t ap swiv yo, t ap kriye fò: “Ozana! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sòm 118:26</ref></char></note>Beni se Sila a ki vini nan non SENYÈ a! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Beni se wayòm zansèt nou David, k ap vini an! Ozana <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:9">Mat 21:9</ref></char></note>nan pi wo a!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:12">Mat 21:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jésus te antre Jérusalem e te antre nan tanp lan. Lè Li te fin gade sou tout bagay, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:17">Mat 21:17</ref></char></note>Li te kite la pou Béthanie avèk douz yo akoz ke lè a te deja fè tà.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Nan demen, lè yo te kite Béthanie, Li te vin grangou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:18-22">Mat 21:18-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Li te wè nan distans, yon pye fig etranje avèk tout fèy yo. Li te ale pou wè si petèt li t ap twouve kèk bagay sou li. Lè l rive, li pa t twouve anyen sof ke fèy yo, paske li pa t nan sezon fwi. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />E Li te pale a li: <char style="wj">“Ke pèsòn pa janm manje fwi ki sòti nan ou ankò!” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">E disip Li yo te tande l.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:13-16">Jn 2:13-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa yo te rive Jérusalem. Li te antre nan tanp lan e te kòmanse voye deyò sila ki t ap achte ak vann nan tanp lan. Li te chavire tab a sila ki t ap chanje lajan yo ak chèz a sila ki t ap vann toutrèl yo. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Li pa t ap kite pèsòn pase nan tanp lan ki pote yon chaj. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Li te kòmanse pale ak yo. Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Èske li pa ekri:</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">És 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jr 7:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Lakay Mwen an ap rele yon Kay Lapriyè pou tout nasyon yo’? Men nou fin fè l vin yon kav kote vòlè kache.” </char><verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Chèf prèt yo avèk skrib yo te tande, e yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:46">Mat 21:46</ref></char></note>te kòmanse ap chèche jan pou detwi Li. Paske yo te pè Li akoz tout foul la te etone pa prensip ke Li te bay yo.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:17">Mat 21:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè aswè te rive, Li te kite vil la.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:19-22">Mat 21:19-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pandan yo t ap pase lantre granmmaten an, yo vin wè ke pye fig etranje a te seche jis rive nan rasin.<verse eid="MRK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Konsa, Pierre te sonje, e te di Li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:7">Mat 23:7</ref></char></note>“Rabbi, gade pye fig frans ke Ou te modi a gen tan vin sèch”.<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Jésus te reponn e te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Mete lafwa nan Bondye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" /><char style="wj">Anverite, Mwen di nou, nenpòt moun ki di a mòn sa a: ‘Retire ou la e ale jete ou nan lanmè, san doute nan kè l, men kwè ke sa li di a va rive, sa va rive. </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" /><char style="wj">Pou sa, Mwen di nou, pou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:7">Mat 7:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">tout bagay ke nou priye e mande, kwè ke nou gen tan resevwa l deja, e li va fèt.</char><verse eid="MRK 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />
    <char style="wj">“Nenpòt lè ke n ap kanpe pou fè lapriyè,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14">Mat 6:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">si nou gen yon bagay kont yon moun, padone l, pou Papa nou osi, ki nan syèl la kapab padone nou pou ofans pa nou yo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:15">Mat 6:15</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Men si nou pa padone, Papa nou nan syèl la p ap padone ofans pa nou yo nonplis.”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Konsa, yo te rive ankò Jérusalem. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref></char></note>E pandan Li t ap mache nan tanp lan, chèf prèt yo avèk skrib yo ak ansyen yo te vin kote L.<verse eid="MRK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Yo te di L: “Pa ki otorite W ap fè bagay sa yo; oubyen kilès ki te bay Ou otorite sa a pou fè bagay sa yo?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“M ap poze nou yon kesyon, e nou va reponn Mwen; epi konsa, Mwen menm, M ap di nou pa ki otorite Mwen fè bagay sa yo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" /><char style="wj">Èske batèm a Jean an te sòti nan syèl la, oubyen nan lòm? Reponn Mwen.” </char><verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Yo te rezone pami yo menm pou di: “Si nou di ‘nan syèl la’, l ap di poukisa nou pa t kwè li? <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Men si nou di de lòm?” Konsa, yo te pè foul la, paske tout moun te konsidere ke Jean te vrèman yon pwofèt.<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Yo te reponn Jésus e te di: “Nou pa konnen”.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Konsa, Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Nonplis, Mwen p ap di nou pa ki otorite Mwen fè bagay sa yo”. </char><verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Konsa, Li te kòmanse pale yo an parabòl: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Yon nonm te plante yon jaden rezen, te antoure l avèk yon miray, e te fouye yon basen anba pèz diven an. Li te bati yon kay gad byen wo, e li te lwe l a kiltivatè yo. Konsa, li te fè yon vwayaj nan yon lòt peyi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" /><char style="wj">Nan lè rekòlt la, li te voye yon esklav li kote kiltivatè yo pou l ta kapab resevwa kèk nan pwodwi jaden an nan men a kiltivatè yo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" /><char style="wj">Konsa, yo te pran li, yo te bat li, e te voye li ale men vid.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" /><char style="wj">Ankò li te voye yon lòt esklav. Yo te blese li nan tèt, e te maltrete l byen maltrete.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" /><char style="wj">Epi li voye yon lòt. Sila a yo te touye. E anpil lòt; kèk yo te bat, e kèk yo te touye.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />
    <char style="wj">“Li te gen youn anplis, yon fis byeneme. Konsa, an dènye lye, li te voye li bay yo. Li te di: ‘Yo va respekte fis mwen an’.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />
    <char style="wj">“Men kiltivatè rezen sa yo te di youn ak lòt: ‘Sa se eritye a; vini, annou touye l e jete l deyò jaden an, e eritaj la ap vin pou nou!’ </char> <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" /><char style="wj">Epi yo te pran li, yo te touye li, e te jete li deyò jaden an.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />
    <char style="wj">“Kisa mèt jaden an ap fè? Li va vin detwi kiltivatè rezen yo, e li va bay jaden an a lòt moun.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" /><char style="wj">Èske nou pa t menm li Ekriti sila a?:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sòm 118:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">‘Wòch ke moun ki t ap bati yo te refize a;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="wj">sila a te devni wòch ang prensipal la. </char><verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:23">Sòm 118:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Sa te vin rive soti nan Bondye,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">
    <char style="wj">e se yon mèvèy nan zye nou.’?” </char><verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Konsa, yo t ap chache sezi li; malgre yo te pè foul la, paske yo te konprann ke Li te pale parabòl sa a kont yo menm. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:22">Mat 22:22</ref></char></note>yo te kite Li e te ale.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Yo te voye kèk nan Farizyen yo ak Ewodyen yo kote Li, pou yo ta kapab pran l nan pèlen avèk pwòp pawòl Li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:54">Luc 11:54</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Yo te vini, e te mande L: “Mèt, nou konnen ke Ou bay verite a, e Ou pa nan patipri a pèsòn, men enstwi chemen Bondye a ak verite: Èske li pèmi pou peye taks a César; wi, oubyen non?<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />“Èske n ap peye, oubyen èske nou p ap peye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:15">Men Li menm ki te konnen se ipokrit yo t ap fè, Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Poukisa nou ap tante Mwen? Pote ban m yon denye (kòb jounalye peyi a) pou M gade l.” </char><verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Epi yo te pote l.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Se imaj ak non a ki moun ki la a?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Yo te di Li: “Se pou César”.<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Konsa, Jésus te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:21">Mat 22:21</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Bay César bagay sila a ki pou César yo, e a Bondye bagay ki pou Bondye yo.” </char> E yo te etone de Li menm.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref></char></note>Sadiseyen yo, ki di ke nanpwen rezirèksyon, te vin kote L e te kesyone L. Yo te di: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Mèt, Moïse te ekri pou nou ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Det 25:5</ref></char></note>‘Si frè a yon nonm mouri, e kite dèyè l madanm li, san li pa gen pitit, ke frè l la dwe pran madanm nan pou fè yon eritye pou frè li a.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Te gen sèt frè; epi premye a te pran yon madanm, e li te mouri san fè eritye. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Epi dezyèm nan te pran l, e te mouri san kite eritye; epi twazyèm nan menm jan an, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Epi menm jan an tout sèt yo, san kite eritye. An dènye lye, fanm nan te mouri tou. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Nan rezirèksyon an, lè yo leve ankò, se madanm a kilès l ap ye? Paske tout sèt yo te genyen l kòm madanm.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Èske se pa pou rezon sa a ke nou twonpe nou an; paske nou pa konprann ni Ekriti yo ni pouvwa Bondye?</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" /><char style="wj">Paske lè yo leve soti nan lanmò, yo p ap marye, ni bay moun nan maryaj, men yo ap tankou zanj nan syèl yo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" /><char style="wj">Men konsènan fè ke mò yo leve ankò a, èske nou pa t li nan</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 20:37">Luc 20:37</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:6">Egz 3:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pasaj liv Moïse la, devan ti bwa brile a, ke Bondye te pale l e te di l: ‘Mwen menm se Bondye Abraham nan, Bondye Isaac ak Bondye Jacob la’?</char><verse eid="MRK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:32">Mat 22:32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Li pa Bondye a mò yo, men a vivan yo. Nou menm nou byen twonpe nou.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luc 10:25-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Youn nan skrib yo te vini e te tande y ap diskite. Akoz ke li te konprann ke Li te reponn yo byen, li te mande L: “Ki kòmandman ki pi enpòtan an?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Epi Jésus te reponn: <char style="wj">“Pi enpòtan an se </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Det 6:5</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">‘Tande O Israël! SENYÈ, Bondye nou an se Yon Sèl SENYÈ a. </char> <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Det 6:5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Ou va renmen SENYÈ ou a, Bondye ou a avèk tout kè ou, avèk tout nanm ou, avèk tout lespri ou, e avèk tout fòs ou.’ </char><verse eid="MRK 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />
    <char style="wj">“Dezyèm nan se sa:</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Ou va renmen vwazen ou an tankou tèt ou.’ Nanpwen lòt kòmandman pi gran pase sa yo.” </char><verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Skrib la te di L: “Se sa Mèt, Ou vrèman pale ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:35">Det 4:35</ref></char></note>Li se Youn, e nanpwen lòt sof ke Li Menm. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Det 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:22">I Sam 15:22</ref></char></note>E pou renmen Li avèk tout kè nou, avèk tout konprann nou, e avèk tout fòs nou, e pou renmen vwazen nou tankou tèt ou, se bokou plis pase tout ofrann brile avèk sakrifis.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Lè Jésus te wè ke li te reponn avèk bon konprann, Li te di li: <char style="wj">“Ou pa lwen wayòm Bondye a”. </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:46">Mat 22:46</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Apre sa, pèsòn pa t tante poze Li okenn lòt kesyon.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jésus te kòmanse di pandan Li t ap enstwi nan tanp lan: <char style="wj">“Kijan sa rive ke skrib yo di ke Kris la se fis a David la?</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" /><char style="wj">Menm David te di nan Lespri Sen an:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sòm 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">‘Senyè a te di a Senyè Mwen an,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">chita sou men dwat Mwen, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">jouk lè ke M mete tout lènmi Ou yo anba pye Ou.’ </char><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />
    <char style="wj">“David li menm rele Li ‘Senyè’, e nan ki sans Li kapab fis Li?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 12:9">Jn 12:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gwo foul pèp la te kontan tande Li.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:1-7">Mat 23:1-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan enstriksyon Li, Li t ap di: <char style="wj">“Fè atansyon kont skrib yo ki renmen mache toupatou ak gwo vètman, e ki renmen resevwa salitasyon ak respè nan mache a, </char> <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" /><char style="wj">ak premye plas nan sinagòg yo, ak pozisyon lonè nan bankè yo,</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 20:47">Luc 20:47</ref></char></note><char style="wj">ki devore kay vèv yo, e pou parèt byen, yo fè gwo priyè. Sila yo ap resevwa yon pi gwo kondanasyon.” </char><verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luc 21:1-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te chita anfas trezò tanp lan, e te kòmanse gade jan foul la t ap mete kòb yo nan trezò a. Anpil moun rich t ap mete gwo lajan ladann. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Epi yon vèv malere te vin mete ladann de ti kòb an kwiv ki te gen valè a yon santim.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Li te rele disip Li yo a Li menm e Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Anverite Mwen di nou, vèv malere sila a te mete plis pase tout lòt ki bay nan trezò a. </char> <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" /><char style="wj">Paske yo tout te mete selon fòs sa yo te genyen, men malgre li te malere, li te mete tout sa li te posede, tout sa ke li te gen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:43">Luc 8:43</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pou li viv.” </char><verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:2">Mat 24:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pandan Li t ap sòti nan tanp lan, youn nan disip Li yo te di Li: “Mèt, gade! A la bèl wòch, e a la bèl konstriksyon!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Ou wè gwo konstriksyon sa yo?</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:44">Luc 19:44</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Pa menm yon wòch va rete sou yon lòt ki p ap dekonble.”</char><verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Pandan Li te chita sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:1">Mat 21:1</ref></char></note>Mòn Oliv la, anfas tanp lan, Pierre avèk Jacques e Jean ak André t ap kesyone L an prive. <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Di nou kilè bagay sa yo ap rive, e kisa k ap yon sign pou lè tout bagay sa yo va akonpli.”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Epi Jésus te kòmanse di yo: <char style="wj">“Veye ke pèsòn pa mete nou nan erè.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" /><char style="wj">Anpil va vini nan non Mwen, e y ap di: </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:24">Jn 8:24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Mwen se Li menm!’ Y ap mennen nou nan anpil erè.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" /><char style="wj">Lè nou tande afè lagè ak bwi lagè, pa enkyete nou. Fòk sa fèt, men se pa lafen.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" /><char style="wj">Paske nasyon va leve kont nasyon, e wayòm kont wayòm. Va gen tranbleman de tè nan plizyè andwa. Va gen famin ak twoub. Bagay sa yo se kòmansman a doulè nesans lan.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />
    <char style="wj">“Men veye nou; paske y ap</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:17">Mat 10:17</ref></char></note><char style="wj">livre nou devan tribinal yo, e nou va resevwa kout fwèt nan sinagòg yo, e nou va kanpe devan gouvènè avèk wa yo pou koz a non Mwen, kon yon temwayaj a yo menm.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" /><char style="wj">Men premyèman, fòk</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:14">Mat 24:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">bòn nouvèl la preche a tout nasyon yo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:19-22">Mat 10:19-22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Lè yo arete nou, e livre nou, pa enkyete nou an avans pou sa ke nou va di, men di nenpòt sa ke nou resevwa nan lè sa a. Paske se pa nou k ap pale, men Lespri Sen an.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />
    <char style="wj">“Konsa, frè va livre frè a lanmò, e yon papa, pitit li. Pitit yo va leve kont paran yo, e fè mete yo a lanmò.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat 10:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Nou va rayi pa tout moun akoz non Mwen, men sila a ki pèsevere jiska lafen an, va sove.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />
    <char style="wj">“Men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:15">Mat 24:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">lè nou wè Abominasyon Dezolasyon an, sila ke Daniel te pale a, k ap kanpe kote li pa ta dwe ye,”</char> (ke sila k ap li sa a konprann), <char style="wj">“alò, kite sila ki nan Juda yo kouri ale nan mòn yo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luc 17:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Epi kite sila ki sou do kay yo pa desann antre ladann pou pran anyen nan kay la.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" /><char style="wj">Epi kite sila ki nan chan an pa retounen pran vètman li.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" /><char style="wj">Men malè a sila avèk pitit nan vant yo, ak sila ki nouris nan jou sa yo.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />
    <char style="wj">“Men priye ke sa pa rive nan sezon fwedi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" /><char style="wj">Paske jou sa yo va yon tribilasyon ki pa janm konn fèt</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">depi kòmansman kreyasyon an ke Bondye te fè, jouk rive koulye a e ki p ap janm fèt ankò.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />
    <char style="wj">“Anmwens ke Bondye te fè jou sa yo pi kout, nanpwen lavi ki t ap sove. Men pou koz a eli ke Li te chwazi yo, Li te fè jou yo vin pi kout. </char> <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" /><char style="wj">E alò, si nenpòt moun ta di nou: “Men Kris la isit la”, oubyen: “Gade, Li la”; pa kwè li.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" /><char style="wj">Paske fo Kris yo ak fo pwofèt yo va parèt, e va montre nou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mat 24:24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sign ak mèvèy jis, si te posib, pou sedwi menm eli yo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" /><char style="wj">Men fè atansyon, gade byen, Mwen te di nou tout bagay davans.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />
    <char style="wj">“Men nan jou sa yo, apre tribilasyon sila yo, solèy la ap vin nwa fonse, e lalin nan p ap bay limyè.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">És 13:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">És 34:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Epi zetwal yo va ap tonbe soti nan syèl la, e pouvwa ki nan syèl yo va sekwe nèt.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />
    <char style="wj">“Nan lè sa a yo va wè</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Fis a Lòm nan k ap vini nan nyaj yo avèk gwo pouvwa avèk glwa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" /><char style="wj">Li va voye zanj Li yo, e yo va </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:4">Det 30:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">ranmase tout eli Li yo, soti nan kat van yo, jis rive nan pwent tè ki pi lwen an, jouk nan pwent syèl ki pi lwen an.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />
    <char style="wj">“Alò, konprann parabòl de pye fig etranje a. Lè branch li vin vèt, e l ap pouse fèy, nou konnen ke gran sezon an prèt pou rive. </char> <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" /><char style="wj">Menm jan an nou menm, lè nou wè bagay sa yo ap fèt, rekonèt ke Li menm Li prè, Li nan pòt la menm.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" /><char style="wj">Anverite Mwen di nou, jenerasyon sila p ap gen tan pase jouk lè ke tout bagay sa yo fèt.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" /><char style="wj">Syèl la ak latè ap pase, men pawòl pa M yo p ap pase.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mat 24:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Men de jou sa a, oubyen lè sa a, pèsòn pa konnen, pa menm zanj ki nan syèl yo, ni Fis la, men sèl Papa a.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" /><char style="wj">Fè atansyon, </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:18">Ef 6:18</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">rete vijilan, paske nou pa konnen lè a.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:36-38">Luc 12:36-38</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Se tankou yon mesye ki sòti nan yon vwayaj ki kite kay li e mete esklav li yo responsab. Li te bay a chak moun, tach li, e osi a gadyen pòt la, pou l ta rete vijilan.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />
    <char style="wj">“Pou sa, rete vijilan. Paske nou pa konnen kilè mèt kay la ap parèt; si se nan aswè, a minwi, oubyen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:30">Mc 14:30</ref></char></note><char style="wj">lè kòk la chante granmmaten;</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" /><char style="wj">sof ke li ta vini sibitman, e twouve nou nan dòmi.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:11">Wo 13:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" /><char style="wj">E sa ke Mwen di nou an, Mwen di li a tout moun:</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:42">Mat 24:42</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Rete vijilan!” </char><verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:2-5">Mat 26:2-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Pak Jwif la avèk Pen San Ledven an, t ap fète nan de jou. Konsa, chèf prèt avèk skrib yo t ap chache kijan pou yo ta sezi L pa riz pou touye Li. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Paske yo t ap di: “Pa pandan fèt la, otreman sa kab fè pèp la fè twoub.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:37-39">Luc 7:37-39</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pandan Li te Béthanie lakay Simon, lepre a, e yo te chita sou tab la, yon fanm te vini avèk yon bokal alabat ranpli avèk nard, ki te koute byen chè. Fanm nan te kraze bokal la, e te vide li sou tèt Jésus.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Men kèk moun te mekontan e te pale youn ak lòt: “Poukisa l ap gaspiye pafen sila a? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Paske pafen sila a ta kapab vann pou plis ke twa san denye (fòs kòb yon jou travay) e li ta kab bay a malere yo.” E yo t ap kritike l.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />
    <char style="wj">Men Jésus te di: “Lese li. Poukisa nou ap twouble li? Li fè M yon bon zèv.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" /><char style="wj">Paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Det 15:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">malere yo ap toujou la avèk nou, e nenpòt lè nou vle, nou kapab fè byen pou yo; men Mwen menm, M p ap la tout tan.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" /><char style="wj">Li fè sa li ta kapab.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:40">Jn 19:40</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Li te fè onksyon kò M davans, pou lantèman an.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" /><char style="wj">Anverite Mwen di nou:</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:13">Mat 26:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Nenpòt kote ke bòn nouvèl la ta preche nan tout lemonn, sa ke fanm sa a fè a, li va pale nan memwa li.” </char><verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Judas Iscariot, ki te youn nan douz yo, te ale bò kote chèf prèt yo pou li ta kapab trayi Jésus a yo menm. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Yo te kontan lè yo te tande sa, e te pwomèt li lajan. Konsa, li t ap chache kijan pou trayi Li nan yon moman favorab.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Mat 26:17-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan premye jou Pen San Ledven an, lè jenn mouton Pak la t ap touye kon sakrifis la, disip Li yo te di Li: “Kote Ou vle nou ale fè preparasyon pou Ou kapab manje Pak la?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Li te voye de nan disip Li yo. Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Antre nan vil la, e yon mesye k ap pote yon krich dlo ap rankontre nou. Swiv li.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" /><char style="wj">Epi nenpòt kote li antre, di a mèt kay la: Mèt la mande: ‘Kote chanm</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:11">Luc 22:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">vizitè Mwen an, pou M kab manje Pak la avèk disip Mwen yo?’ </char> <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" /><char style="wj">Li menm va montre nou yon gran chanm anlè, byen founi e prè. Prepare pou nou la.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Konsa, disip yo te sòti e te vini nan vil la. Yo te twouve l jan ke Li te eksplike yo a. Konsa, yo te prepare Pak la la.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:18">Jn 13:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè li te fènwa, li te vini avèk douz yo.<verse eid="MRK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Pandan yo te chita a tab e t ap manje, Jésus te di: <char style="wj">“Anverite, Mwen di nou ke youn nan nou va trayi Mwen; li menm k ap manje avè M.” </char><verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Yo te kòmanse tris. Yo t ap mande Li youn pa youn: “Asireman se pa mwen!”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Se youn nan douz yo; youn ki tranpe manje l nan veso ansanm avè M nan. </char> <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" /><char style="wj">Paske Fis a Lòm nan gen pou ale, jan ke sa ekri sou Li a; men malè a nonm sa a, pa li menm Fis a Lòm nan trayi a. Li t ap pi bon pou li si li pa t janm fèt.” </char><verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 10:16">Mc 10:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pandan yo t ap manje, Li te pran pen an, e apre yon benediksyon, Li te kase li, te bay yo, e te di: <char style="wj">“Pran sa; se kò Mwen.” </char><verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Li te pran yon tas, te bay gras, e Li te bay yo li. Yo tout te bwè ladann. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Konsa Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Sa se</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Egz 24:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">san akò Mwen ki vèse pou anpil moun.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" /><char style="wj">Anverite Mwen di nou, Mwen p ap janm bwè fwi rezen ankò jouk jou ke M bwè l de nouvo nan wayòm Bondye a.” </char><verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:30">Mat 26:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Apre yo te fin chante yon kantik, yo ale deyò nan Mòn Oliv la.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Akoz Mwen menm, nou tout va fè lachit aswe a; paske sa ekri:</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Za 13:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Mwen va frape bèje atè a, e mouton yo va gaye’.</char><verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />
    <char style="wj">“Men apre M fin leve,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mat 28:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">M ap prale devan nou Galilée.” </char><verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Men Pierre te di Li: “Menm si tout moun chite; mwen menm, m p ap fè sa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Jésus te di l: <char style="wj">“Anverite, Mwen di ou, ke,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:34">Mat 26:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nan menm nwit sa a, ou va nye Mwen twa fwa avan </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:68-72">Mc 14:68-72</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kòk la gen tan chante de fwa.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Men Pierre te kontinye pèsiste: “Menm si mwen oblije mouri avè Ou, Mwen p ap nye Ou.” Konsa, yo tout t ap di menm bagay la tou.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te vini nan yon plas yo te rele Gethsémané. Li te di disip Li yo: <char style="wj">“Chita isit la jouk lè ke M fin priye.” </char><verse eid="MRK 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:15">Mc 9:15</ref></char></note>pran avè L Pierre, Jacques, ak Jean, e Li te kòmanse trè enkyete, e twouble. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Li te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:38">Mat 26:38</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Nanm Mwen gen yon tristès pwofon; jis nan pwen pou M mouri. Rete la e veye toujou.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Li te ale yon ti kras pi devan, te tonbe atè e te kòmanse priye pou, si se te posib, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:45">Mat 26:45</ref></char></note>lè sa a ta kapab pase de Li. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Li t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:15">Wo 8:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Abba! Papa! Tout bagay posib pou Ou; retire tas sa a sou Mwen.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mat 26:39</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Malgre pa kon Mwen vle a, men kon Ou vle a.” </char><verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Li vini e twouve yo t ap dòmi. Li te di a Pierre: <char style="wj">“Simon, èske w ap dòmi? Èske ou pa t kapab rete veye pou yon sèl èdtan?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:41">Mat 26:41</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Kontinye veye e priye pou ou pa antre nan tantasyon. Lespri a dispoze, men chè la fèb.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Konsa, yon lòt fwa Li te ale priye, e te di menm mo yo. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ankò, Li te vini e te twouve yo t ap dòmi, paske zye yo te byen lou. Ni yo pa t konnen kisa pou yo ta di Li.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Li te vini yon twazyèm fwa e te di yo: <char style="wj">“ Dòmi toujou e pran repo nou. Sa sifi.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:35">Mc 14:35</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Lè a fin rive. Gade, Fis a Lòm nan ap trayi pou rive nan men pechè yo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" /><char style="wj">Leve! An ale nou! Gade, sila a ki trayi M nan parèt.” </char><verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan menm moman an, pandan Li toujou t ap pale, Judas, youn nan douz yo, te vin parèt, akonpanye pa yon foul avèk nepe ak baton ki te sòti nan chèf prèt yo, avèk skrib yo, ak ansyen yo.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Alò, sila ki t ap trayi Li a, te bay yo yon siyal lè l te di: “Nenpòt moun ke m bo, se Li menm. Sezi Li e mennen Li ale anba gad yo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Lè l rive, l ale lapoula bò kote Li, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:7">Mat 23:7</ref></char></note>“Mèt!”, e te bo Li.<verse eid="MRK 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Yo te mete men sou Li e te sezi Li. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Men yon sèten mesye nan sila ki te kanpe la yo te rale nepe li. Li te frape esklav a wo prèt la, e te koupe retire zòrèy li.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Jésus te reponn e te di yo: <char style="wj">“Èske nou vini avèk nepe ak baton pou arete M, konsi nou ta kab kont yon vòlè?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" /><char style="wj">Chak jou Mwen te avèk nou </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:35">Mc 12:35</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">nan tanp la ap enstwi, e nou pa t janm sezi M. Men sa fèt pou Ekriti yo kapab akonpli.” </char> <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Konsa, yo tout te kouri kite Li.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Yon sèten jennonm t ap swiv Li, abiye sèl ak yon dra lèn ki kouvri kò l toutouni. Jennom yo te sezi li, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />men li te rale kò l pou l kite dra a, e chape toutouni.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:53 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26:57-68</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te mennen Jésus ale vè wo prèt la. Tout chèf prèt avèk ansyen yo, ak skrib yo te reyini ansanm.<verse eid="MRK 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Pierre te swiv Li a yon distans, jouk L antre nan lakou wo prèt la. Li te chita avèk ofisye yo e t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:67">Mc 14:67</ref></char></note>chofe kò li bò kote dife a.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Alò, chèf prèt yo avèk tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:22">Mat 5:22</ref></char></note>konsèy la t ap eseye twouve temwayaj kont Jésus, pou mete L a lanmò. Men yo pa t twouve anyen. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Paske anpil t ap bay fo temwayaj kont Li, men temwayaj yo pa t koresponn. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Kèk te kanpe e te bay fo temwayaj kont Li. Yo t ap di: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Nou te tande Li di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat 26:61</ref></char></note>‘Mwen va detwi tanp sa ki fèt avèk men, e nan twa jou, mwen va bati yon lòt ki fèt san men.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Epi menm nan sa a, temwayaj yo pa t koresponn.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Wo prèt la te leve. Li te vini devan, e te kesyone Jésus. Li te di: “Èske ou pa reponn kesyon yo? Kisa ke moun sa yo ap temwaye konsa kont ou yo?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Men Li te rete an silans, e pa t reponn yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:63">Mat 26:63</ref></char></note>Ankò wo prèt la te poze L kesyon e t ap di Li: “Èske Ou menm se Kris la, Fis a Sila Ki Beni an?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Jésus te reponn li: <char style="wj">“Se Mwen. Nou va wè </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sòm 110:1</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Fis a Lòm nan vin chita bò dwat Pwisans lan, e</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">vini avèk nwaj nan syèl yo.” </char><verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Konsa, wo prèt la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:6">Nonb 14:6</ref></char></note>chire rad li. Li te di: “Kisa nou bezwen kòm temwayaj ankò? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Nou tande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24:16</ref></char></note>blasfèm nan! Kisa sa sanble selon nou menm?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Konsa, yo tout te kondane Li, ke Li te merite lanmò. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Epi kèk te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:67">Mat 26:67</ref></char></note>krache sou Li, e bat Li avèk kout pwen. Yo t ap di L: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:64">Luc 22:64</ref></char></note>“Pwofetize!” Ofisye yo te fwape L ak kalòt nan figi.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:66 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26:69-75</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Pierre te anba nan lakou tribinal la. Yon fi ki sèvi nan kay a wo prèt la te vini. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />E lè l wè Pierre ki t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:67 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:54">Mc 14:54</ref></char></note>chofe kò l, li byen gade l e te di: “Ou te la tou avèk Jésus, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:67 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mc 1:24</ref></char></note>Nazareyen an.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Men Li te demanti sa, e te di: “Mwen pa menm konnen, ni konprann, kisa w ap pale a.” Epi li ale sou galeri deyò a.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Sèvant kay la te wè li e te kòmanse di ankò a sila ki te la yo: “Sila a se youn nan yo!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Men ankò, li t ap demanti sa a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">E apre kèk tan, sila ki te la yo t ap di ankò a Pierre: “Asireman ou se youn nan yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:70 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:73">Mat 26:73</ref></char></note>paske ou menm osi se yon Galilyen.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Men li te kòmanse bay madichon e joure: “Mwen pa konnen nonm sila a ke n ap pale a.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Imedyatman, kòk la te chante pou dezyèm fwa a. E Pierre te sonje jan Jésus te di l la: <char style="wj">“Avan</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:72 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:30-68">Mc 14:30-68</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kòk la chante de fwa, ou va nye M twa fwa.” </char> Nan sonje sa a, li te kòmanse kriye.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mat 27:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan granmmaten, chèf prèt avèk ansyen yo ak skrib yo, ansanm ak tout konsèy la te reyini lamenm. Yo te mare Jésus, e te mennen Li ale pou livre Li bay Pilate.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">Mat 27:11-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pilate te kesyone L: “Èske Ou se Wa a Jwif yo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Li te reponn yo e te di li: <char style="wj">“Se ou ki di l.” </char><verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Chèf prèt yo te akize L byen sevè sou anpil bagay.<verse eid="MRK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilate t ap kesyone L toujou. Li te di: “Kòmsi Ou pa reponn? Ou pa wè konbyen akizasyon y ap pote kont Ou?”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Men Jésus <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:12">Mat 27:12</ref></char></note>pa t reponn anplis, jiskaske Pilate te etone.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, nan fèt la, li te konn lage pou yo, yon prizonye ki chwazi selon demann pa yo. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Epi te gen yon mesye yo rele Barabbas, ki te vin pran prizon, ansanm avèk sila ki t ap fè revòlt yo. Mesye sa yo, te responsab touye moun. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Foul la te pwoche Pilate, e te kòmanse mande l fè sa ke li te gen abitid fè pou yo a. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilate te reponn yo. Li te mande: “Èske nou vle ke m ta lage pou nou Wa a Jwif yo?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Paske li te byen konprann ke chèf prèt yo te livre Li akoz jalouzi.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Men chèf prèt yo te chofe foul la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:14">Trav 3:14</ref></char></note>pou mande Pilate, olye sa a, pou li ta lage bay yo Barabbas.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Epi Pilate te reponn yo ankò: “Ebyen, kisa pou m ta fè avèk Li menm ke nou rele Wa Jwif yo?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Konsa, yo te rele fò: “Krisifye Li!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Men Pilate t ap di yo: “Poukisa? Ki mal Li fè?” Men yo te rele pi fò: “Krisifye Li!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Akoz ke li te vle satisfè foul la, Pilate te lage Barabbas pou yo. Lè li te fin fè yo bat Jésus <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:26">Mat 27:26</ref></char></note>ak fwèt, li te livre L, pou L ta krisifye.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27:27-31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sòlda yo te pran L antre nan lakou a (sa vle di Pretwa a). Yo te rele ansanm yon kowòt Women antye. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Yo te abiye Li an mov, e lè yo te fin trese yon kouwòn zepin, yo te mete l sou tèt Li. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Konsa, yo te kòmanse salye Li: “Sali, Wa a Jwif yo!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Yo te kontinye bat tèt Li avèk yon wozo, yo te krache sou Li. Yo te mete yo ajenou, epi yo te bese devan Li. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Lè yo te fin moke L, yo retire vètman mov la, e te mete pwòp rad Li sou Li. E yo te mennen Li deyò pou krisifye Li. <verse eid="MRK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:32">Mat 27:32</ref></char></note>Yo te pran yon mesye pa lafòs ki t ap sòti andeyò pou fè l fè kòve; Simon de Cyrène, (papa a Alexandre ak Rufus), pou pote kwa Li a.<verse eid="MRK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Konsa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:33-44">Mat 27:33-44</ref></char></note>mennen Li nan plas Golgotha, ki tradwi kon Plas A Zo Bwatèt. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Yo te eseye bay Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:34">Mat 27:34</ref></char></note>diven mele avèk myrr; men Li pa t pran li. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Epi yo te krisifye Li e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Sòm 22:18</ref></char></note>divize vètman Li yo pami yo menm. Yo te fè tiraj osò pou yo detèmine sa ke yo chak ta pran.<verse eid="MRK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Se te nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:33">Mc 15:33</ref></char></note>twazyèm lè ke yo te krisifye Li a.<verse eid="MRK 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Lenskripsyon avèk detay akizasyon kont Li an te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:37">Mat 27:37</ref></char></note>“Wa a Jwif yo”.<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Konsa,yo te krisifye de vòlè avè L; youn sou men dwat Li, e youn sou men goch Li. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Epi konsa, Lekriti sen an te akonpli ki te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">És 53:12</ref></char></note>“Epi Li te konte pami malfektè yo.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Sila ki t ap pase yo t ap voye ensilt; yo t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Sòm 22:7</ref></char></note>souke tèt yo e t ap di: “Gade! Ou menm ki t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mc 14:58</ref></char></note>detwi tanp lan, e rebati li nan twa jou. <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Sove tèt Ou, e desann sou kwa a!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Menm jan an, chèf prèt yo ansanm avèk skrib yo, t ap moke Li pami yo menm e t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:42">Mat 27:42</ref></char></note>“Li te sove lòt yo; Li pa kapab sove tèt Li.” <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />“Kite Kris sa a, Wa Israël La, desann kwa a koulye a pou nou kapab wè e kwè!” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:44">Mat 27:44</ref></char></note>Sila ki te krisifye avèk Li yo t ap ensilte L menm jan an.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:1">Sòm 22:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè sizyèm lè a te rive, tenèb te tonbe sou tout latè jiska nevyèm lè. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Nan nevyèm lè a, Jésus te kriye fò avèk yon gwo vwa: <char style="wj">“Eloi, Eloi, lama sabachthani?” </char> ki tradwi <char style="wj">“Bondye M, Bondye M, poukisa Ou abandone Mwen?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:34">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:1">Sòm 22:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Lè kèk nan moun ki te la yo tande sa, yo te di: “Gade, L ap rele Élie.”<verse eid="MRK 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Yon moun te kouri ale pran yon eponj e te ranpli li avèk vinèg si. Li te mete l sou yon wozo, e te bay Li bwè. Li te di: “ Kite l konsa! Annou wè koulye a si Élie ap vin fè L desann.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:50">Mat 27:50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, Jésus te pouse yon gwo kri, e te rann dènye souf li.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Egz 26:31-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vwal tanp lan te chire an de, soti anwo, jis rive anba.<verse eid="MRK 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:54">Mat 27:54</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè santenye Women nan, ki te kanpe tou dwat devan Li a, te wè jan Li te rann dènye souf Li a, li te di: “Anverite, nonm sila a se te Fis Bondye a.”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Luc 23:49</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Te gen osi, fanm ki t ap veye a yon distans. Pami yo se te Marie Magdalène, e Marie, manman a Jacques Le Mineur, avèk Joset, e Salomé. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Lè Li te Galilée, yo te konn swiv Li e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55">Mat 27:55</ref></char></note>sèvi Li, e anpil lòt fanm osi te vin monte avèk Li Jérusalem.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Lè aswè te rive, akoz Jou Preparasyon an, sa vle di, jou avan Saba a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Joseph Arimathée <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:57">Mat 27:57</ref></char></note>te vini. Li te yon manm enpòtan nan Konsèy la, e li osi t ap tann wayòm Bondye a. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:38">Jn 19:38</ref></char></note>ranmase kouraj li pou ale devan Pilate, e li te mande kò Jésus a.<verse eid="MRK 15:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilate te vle konnen si Li te gen tan mouri. Li te rele santenye Women an, e te mande l si li te mouri deja. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Konsa, lè l vin konprann sa selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:39">Mc 15:39</ref></char></note>santenye Women an, li te bay kò a a Joseph.<verse eid="MRK 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Joseph te pote yon twal lèn, te desann Li, e te vlope L nan twal lèn an. Li te mete L nan tonm ki te fouye nan wòch la, e li te woule yon gwo wòch kont antre a tonm nan.<verse eid="MRK 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:56">Mat 27:56</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Marie Magdala, avèk Marie, manman Joses te wè kote yo te mete Li.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 20:1-8">Jn 20:1-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè Saba a te fini, Marie Magdala, avèk Marie, manman a Jacques, ak Salomé, te pote epis pou yo ta kab fè onksyon kò Li. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Epi trè bonè, nan premye jou semèn nan, yo te vini nan tonm nan lè solèy la t ap fenk leve. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />E yo t ap di youn ak lòt: “Kilès k ap woule <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:60">Mat 27:60</ref></char></note>wòch la sòti nan antre tonm nan pou nou?”<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Nan gade anlè, yo te wè ke wòch la te deja gen tan woule sòti, malgre ke li te byen gwo. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:11-12">Jn 20:11-12</ref></char></note>Epi lè yo te antre nan tonm nan, yo te wè yon jennonm ki te chita sou bò dwat, abiye ak yon vètman blan, epi yo te sezi.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Li te di yo: “Pa sezi, nou ap chache Jésus, Nazareyen ki te krisifye a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:6">Mat 28:6</ref></char></note>Li leve. Li pa isit la. Gade, la se plas kote yo te mete L la. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Men ale, pale disip Li yo, ansanm avèk Pierre; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mat 26:32</ref></char></note>L ap prale devan nou Galilée. La nou va wè Li jan ke Li te di nou an.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Yo te fè vit sove ale kite tonm nan, akoz tranbleman ak sezisman te gen tan pran yo. Yo pa t di anyen a pèsòn, paske yo te krent.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Alò, apre Li te leve bonè nan premye jou semèn nan, Li te parèt premyèman a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:56">Mat 27:56</ref></char></note>Marie Magdala, moun sou sila ke Li te retire sèt move lespri yo. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:18">Jn 20:18</ref></char></note>Marie te ale bay rapò a sila ki te konn avèk Li yo pandan yo te nan doulè e t ap kriye. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Lè yo te tande ke Li te vivan, e li te wè L, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:17">Mat 28:17</ref></char></note>yo te refize kwè sa.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Epi apre sa, Li te parèt nan yon lòt fòm a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luc 24:13-35</ref></char></note>yo de pandan yo t ap mache fè wout yo andeyò. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Epi yo te kite la, e te ale bay rapò a lòt yo, men yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:17">Mat 28:17</ref></char></note>pa t kwè yo nonplis.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Apre, Li te vin parèt a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:36">Luc 24:36</ref></char></note>onz yo menm, pandan yo te sou tab. Li te bay yo repwòch pou enkredilite ak kè di yo, paske yo pa t kwè sila ki te wè l yo apre li te leve a.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Li te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mat 28:19</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ale nan tout lemonn e preche bòn nouvèl la a tout kreyasyon an.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" /><char style="wj">Sila ki kwè e vin batize yo, va sove; men sila ki pa kwè yo, va kondane.</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:18-36">Jn 3:18-36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" /><char style="wj">Sign sa yo ap swiv sila ki kwè yo.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:38">Mc 9:38</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Nan non pa M, yo va chase move lespri yo; yo va pale an lang tounèf;</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" /><char style="wj">yo va kenbe koulèv, e si yo bwè nenpòt pwazon mòtèl, li p ap fè yo anyen; yo va</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:23">Mc 5:23</ref></char></note><char style="wj">mete men sou malad yo, e y ap refè.”</char><verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Alò, lè SENYÈ a te fin pale avèk yo, Li te monte resevwa nan syèl la, e te chita sou men dwat Bondye. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:51">Luc 9:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Konsa, yo te ale deyò e te preche toupatou, pandan Senyè a te avèk yo, e te konfìme pawòl pa sign ki te swiv yo. Amen.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>